般像 `mpg-...`）\n\n拿到后发我（或你自己本机配置），我就能帮你把插件彻底打通。\n\n---\n\n### 3) 配置到 OpenClaw（两种方式）\n**方式A（推荐，我来代你配）**  \n你把 key 发我，我直接写入并重启验证。\n\n**方式B（你自己本机 PowerShell）**\n```powershell\n[System.Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable(\"MEMOS_API_KEY\", \"mpg-你的key\", \"User\")\n```\n然后重启 OpenClaw gateway。\n\n---\n\n如果你愿意，我下一步直接帮你做“连通性验证”（是否能 recall/add 成功）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0daa48a560868eb20169b9f15ce370819181e80319b2f9d5a9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":34846,"output":364,"cacheRead":7808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43018,"cost":{"input":0.0609805,"output":0.005096,"cacheRead":0.0013664,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0674429}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773793630418}}
