{"type":"message","id":"240c8003","parentId":"acce35d4","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:28:13.242Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**生成简明中文回复**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08c33a23541ee44e0169b9f19379f08191a6d541b7954f870f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpufGUtELMWPQdP27KAolFuDiSUIhTBmUlbWanLXxsUoynUMqdm0jRJAZzrN2QdJwFFouDxbHjhIABv_33M0Kr42a2DlSBJ65kEq8ToBZ9eJUPD2scaON6zuE3YAC8f9_BXHRgOJ3hCHvu1iWShHj-xeVJEemkFRTXImrE9gKpsjVJQ_bF-caGypSgi2spxPE9jhAVJmY_f_tm26OOPcobD5e91gkImna9DsW44-jnO9Ldb11n7JQoPbH4GID6EVPT-6dBt__t_7cvnn9uJhXC6yvu418H4HwDNmTwsa8jqnqOsTFa2_oUTDdmW2gb-yjsZ7GDAfYtpqC8WUpzxTzaXF_Zt8tbmkIMacpyP358N0hT3Z0NRynqKCgcKNxh5BeFLk5ywe8AeNuZZX34YyrMLbzqbVeIlBiMlO87SCejuQVMZs-VsOppy1RbZBCBj4zbajGrl4J-d1dTrPsnW7SqtG484Hs3PJK6CFZeqDOER_7f1PR6SZoXXdvjpSljHKY83YHbptB6CnZ4jhxScEGlJW_7OKJt0XNgbdAXErGYfeS2ypnyjdN15NzXAwNbzpK9wtKsLTkNWnsjTUclo4cmBgJ6zTBlHSNyxADrDy9fsjDXgmOIhArdBl8gZdUzNiJCYYj5CuxMJ81p3_VosncFgzutjJoJDvh-nSzKnN2LLBR8igbd3e_2EOlSwApO9hbgxuC2PvuhOH9VnPTCaswTkmQCP4zjvZX5yge7kIQhJBdlEnesagCeGcSOo-FzOSot3XJE1pdH1bqU4dENTHQ9hxweXwfpmao25Kh8XViMEUZ0daW31oPLBVFoiwGq1jkXNlGkYE7p8q5bCPeIrLkb5AqEv0XhUmE4ou8ma8SkIZLR9j4t6nOXfJj24WiFqiEGv-HHRnQZD8ffFUwO4Kk8jEhZi64kERx_WaVlPTLdlBvR6SdNnEk2wrrHMF0qmaeLkOeZ\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**生成简明中文回复**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 一句话：**本地配置是“告诉 OpenClaw 怎么用”**，**API Key 是“向 MemOS 证明你有权限用”**。\n\n具体点：\n\n- **本地配置（openclaw.json / 环境变量设置）**  \n  像是参数面板：用哪个插件、开不开、URL 是什么、策略怎么走。  \n  没有它，OpenClaw 不知道该连谁、怎么连。\n\n- **API Key（MEMOS_API_KEY）**  \n  像是门禁卡/密码：请求发到 MemOS Cloud 时必须带上。  \n  没有它，就算本地配置全对，也会被服务端拒绝（401/鉴权失败）。\n\n---\n\n你现在的状态可以理解为：\n- 插件和本地配置：✅ 已装好、已启用  \n- API Key：❌ 还没填，所以“能跑框架，但记忆云端服务不可用”\n\n你把 key 配上后，这套才会真正开始“记住你”。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08c33a23541ee44e0169b9f19432b08191892322e552174915\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":533,"output":259,"cacheRead":42496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43288,"cost":{"input":0.00093275,"output":0.003626,"cacheRead":0.0074367999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01199555}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773793687541}}
