{"type":"message","id":"894b2de9","parentId":"22b30ba5","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:42:25.300Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] 发送未受信任元数据的实体为 'openclaw-control-ui'，其标识符为 'openclaw-control-ui'。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] Two deployment modes are supported: cloud and local. The cloud version, '@memtensor/memos-cloud-openclaw-plugin', offers ease of use and continuous service upgrades but transmits data through the cloud. The local version, '@memtensor/memos-local-openclaw-plugin', keeps data on-device or within the internal network, providing higher control and privacy, though it requires self-deployment, maintenance, and upgrades. Users can choose based on their needs without being locked into one option.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] 用户已安装并启用 BrowserWing（browserwing-executor）和 Agent Reach（agent-reach），二者均已处于 ready 状态，可直接使用。系统已验证其可用性。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The WhatsApp gateway is connected.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] 用户希望分析自身使用习惯，以自动优化 'Lobster' 的回复风格与内容逻辑。该目标技术上可行，实现路径包括行为观察、规则提取、自动应用与反馈调整、以及安全边界设定。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:38] 用户现在期望系统在不指定具体技能的情况下，能够自动识别问题类型、匹配最适配的技能（或组合）并直接执行；仅对高风险外部操作请求确认。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] 用户已成功激活 Office-Automation（gog）、Self-Improving Agent（self-evolution + self-improving-agent）、skill-finder（find-skills + skill-feed）和 Skill Creator（skill-creator），所有功能均确认就绪可用。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] 用户已被告知 BrowserWing 与 Agent Reach 在第三方安全评估中被标记为 High Risk（Snyk 风险评级），建议采取最小权限原则，并仅在必要时调用相关功能。\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 09:38] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望在提问时自动匹配并调用合适的技能\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] [Implicit Preference] The user prefers automated tools that enhance productivity and facilitate skill development.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于本地版插件以获取更高的可控性和隐私\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Implicit Preference] 用户倾向于使用性能更好且更高效的工具来完成浏览器相关的任务\n   -[2026-03-18 09:38] [Implicit Preference] 希望自动匹配和调用最合适的技能，无需手动指定\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 09:42 GMT+9] 这俩都能干什么"}],"timestamp":1773794545299}}
{"type":"message","id":"92fdccf5","parentId":"894b2de9","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:42:35.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Providing concise Chinese explanation**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0483e3f128d7ce540169b9f4ee51448191b41b4bc0563f5e87\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpufTvnAGVNGW4RGdqhcpDxTCXY-_Fe3D-L9BQjKW1zLN0PWGBD44bMKE4TpmbRoQS4ZYPjRgMZ14NQQxaFwIRtJr4aDRtbKAXnJlRMyMIzIV19o472kHBFGK8V85-bDtd2wa-JIZSgU5ly_xvesYRAhkdhPC1JbWFcmWLcdVmvETPaGrsyALmcr6f3fRruEc3CD-eqSUKV0PuWRfvLkvUdUsT9cyA7CWbxbmBWb0sjan6rkVS0vLrxqL1oVgJR_5U0y27gmEqO0yo7HyiB1m3WI5U7yakKzUELhEZMKnIEgjBpaUyUl7aNci7FIg2lPvObAqfVZI5i1DNVpGwPpgn7bXmlx6ucUX6YBu_Wc-zGYYBSVVaadcV74SJ94BlC0Ls072wrPcAY-0vCitGgCkyU04e6dagIUS56UhloodVPV88M_oqhKFCTuOYKth7IGciRLMCWadCl1nwjho-8T-hVQwQEAEdi8nGcs_cbjX-RxiQ256KNIeY8cszmOm2SbXZF4N5aMGBgsUXCG0RmphFvwMBGoPsveVg0xHo5F5f8E8e3NKvWH4k0opICMGOLYUD1erraMU1MPj0Nyw6WwY_JDn-EG8VHNrWENQbxmlAuA8UchP5QxkdWA9bE9oHbQjN8lF43QvqYa_-2KU0DPfZ8uixeqGFpCKDBbs3cXqyCa6ErRlKLttJKuc5R2sBanwiEKYO9ut9ywU9ii8hpdNrv16AVZCDxMyHE9sQNelO8anY9XsnAS7fZ8km526LeSNaa0vkG1KOjZNmcQR9dR_4vzQsDMmyOYjP4XxIIxOn2_MoIft9bE3wxYiWlmpTG8Wm2I2HL1U5EbunEczVMwUwZXxBVJCHOkChpX0xJtCTag7gxzV3FiZS_jorowyfHOGW2Q82B01CJja1e3H92QO0kOVR6_VR8wPLMCvwENJyH8EvFvupoO-9FdWfq6FZDw8s_n024-0ig1SmlPlUAx3ol0zW9kBKbE_z1UjY8RvcpAG5kpUX5iFKm6245q1DvtoPUmIq\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Providing concise Chinese explanation**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，给你说人话版：\n\n### 1) BrowserWing（`browserwing-executor`）=「会操作网页的手+眼」\n它擅长**真实浏览器自动化**，比如：\n- 打开网页、跳转、登录后继续操作\n- 点按钮、填表单、下拉选择、翻页\n- 抓页面元素、截图、跑一点 JS\n- 适合“必须在网页里一步步操作”的任务\n\n**典型场景**：  \n“帮我登录后台导出报表”“帮我在某网站提交表单”“按步骤点完这个流程”。\n\n---\n\n### 2) Agent Reach（`agent-reach`）=「多平台内容雷达+提取器」\n它擅长**跨平台搜和读内容**，比如：\n- 按平台/关键词搜索（X、Reddit、YouTube、GitHub、小红书、B站、微博等）\n- 给我一个链接，它快速提取正文、要点、结构化信息\n- 做多来源比对、汇总、研究型检索\n\n**典型场景**：  \n“搜小红书上这个话题的高赞观点”“把这10个链接提炼成结论”“看这个视频/帖子讲了啥”。\n\n---\n\n### 你可以这么理解\n- **BrowserWing**：偏“执行操作”（动手）\n- **Agent Reach**：偏“信息获取与提炼”（动脑找料）\n\n---\n\n### 组合用法（最强）\n先用 **Agent Reach** 找到高价值链接/内容，再用 **BrowserWing** 进入具体页面做深度操作（登录后抓取、分页采集、截图留证等）。  \n\n你后面直接说目标就行，比如：  \n“帮我研究XX话题并整理结论”——我会自动判断是单用还是组合用。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0483e3f128d7ce540169b9f4ef294481918e2264454c53d15f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":21438,"output":449,"cacheRead":18944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40831,"cost":{"input":0.0375165,"output":0.006286,"cacheRead":0.0033152,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0471177}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773794545300}}
