:"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 看了，就是这个项目：**HKUDS/CLI-Anything**  \nGitHub：<https://github.com/HKUDS/CLI-Anything>\n\n我帮你快速过了一遍，结论：\n\n- ✅ **已开源**\n- ✅ 定位是：把各种软件“CLI 化 / Agent-Native”，让 OpenClaw、Claude Code、Codex 这类代理能直接调用\n- ✅ 支持多平台接入（README 里明确提到 OpenClaw）\n- ✅ 有中文文档（`README_CN.md`）\n- ✅ 活跃度挺高（我抓到时大约 **17.7k stars**，最近几小时还有更新，数据会波动）\n\n你图里的“CLI-Anything”就是它。\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接帮你做两件事（二选一）：\n1) **只读评估版**：我给你拆解它和你现在 BrowserWing/Agent Reach 的关系，告诉你“该不该接、怎么接最稳”。  \n2) **实装版**：我按你当前 OpenClaw 环境给你出一套最小接入步骤（尽量不动现有配置）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02f68b5bb8b348c90169b9f616d5d88191abe65cdff1a31697\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":4054,"output":383,"cacheRead":94976,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99413,"cost":{"input":0.0070945,"output":0.005362,"cacheRead":0.016620799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029077299999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773794838663}}
