{"type":"message","id":"16bc4d59","parentId":"0a07d135","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:49:27.978Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The entity sending untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] The project 'CLI-Anything' (HKUDS/CLI-Anything) on GitHub is open source, supports multi-platform integration including OpenClaw, has Chinese documentation, and is actively maintained with approximately 17.7k stars as of March 18, 2026.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] The user agrees to integrate CLI-Anything with a cautious, gray-scale approach: start with a low-risk workflow (e.g., file batch processing/export), use minimal permissions, require structured output (JSON), run 20–50 test cycles before scaling, and keep high-risk actions under manual confirmation.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] Two deployment modes are supported: cloud and local. The cloud version, '@memtensor/memos-cloud-openclaw-plugin', offers ease of use and continuous service upgrades but transmits data through the cloud. The local version, '@memtensor/memos-local-openclaw-plugin', keeps data on-device or within the internal network, providing higher control and privacy, though it requires self-deployment, maintenance, and upgrades. Users can choose based on their needs without being locked into one option.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] 用户已成功激活 Office-Automation（gog）、Self-Improving Agent（self-evolution + self-improving-agent）、skill-finder（find-skills + skill-feed）和 Skill Creator（skill-creator），所有功能均确认就绪可用。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:38] The user expects the system to automatically identify problem types, match the most suitable skills or combinations, and execute them directly without requiring explicit skill specification, except for high-risk external operations which require confirmation.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] The user wants to analyze their own usage habits to automatically optimize Lobster's reply style and content logic. The technical path includes behavior observation, rule extraction, automatic application, feedback adjustment, and safety boundary setting.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] The user is aware that BrowserWing and Agent Reach are marked as High Risk (Snyk rating) and should be used with minimal permissions, only when necessary.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS API Key has been written, the gateway has restarted successfully, and the MemOS Cloud memory plugin is now available.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望进行小规模试点后再逐步放权\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] [Implicit Preference] The user prefers automated tools that enhance productivity and facilitate skill development.\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 09:49 GMT+9] 他说的很厉害 都能干什么 有参考例子吗"}],"timestamp":1773794967975}}
{"type":"message","id":"3edc0c16","parentId":"16bc4d59","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:49:45.526Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0887f7f080da81b30169b9f6985bb48191866a8deba1d7509e\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpufaZ4FRLTQkGmrWSPnkFL9CgxVt1aAtM3xfPqaVOI6yQ66pt8G_0QVa_u7MXChEIsbUlhJuLAxW-gFJcjQHQPzrR8VcizSfPjPEDychOKBezJlAPgE4JwitkoSQnvYCKfFD94WSk-vE3w-mCvm0kQ_cefB_QQl1WDNxY3uAMLT-NFs4GXHaiGLtTAjRYnpFvka0GTJv7f5kfpIb05lCfmc_ciB_ifPrSAVvKS2UjJy_vshTVQgZaQxYU-KVDidmNMwQIs9fCiiF0jISXR-jwzlVCA2ttPeG__EG_lWUNsA__vIjqkO8bJXXLVtLmN5uU75tQquA2_KzvikrGDrBhwIvWiR37x4iG03MIddPOnNBNpr2Yf9G0P0dNq9cJD2trJLAXi3dQs0yXU4Mzl7s7difNTz8WMJL4UqGRvK292goMH7-RRJtGaYYEySdsf8VjBAP3ME-id0T8XRzxE0mY0kXJrdmRPDlW0gmvOd2najdiAmbPkLTLbqQcWytYc--5z2nWLCZ6MMW1qk-KHWdmuQpBiglI80bHEyIt16HVDl4rfs5G2koGCXOvd9FR7dB1xbkCWQY93LHV2cxTJthiBESTfbLzp-TtmJuj7szatTb_6yuvoXmxkiKICFLJmKz3rzt0kVsvkEFekMMprujKOuusDHbeIsvE9OtiuBfq2L4y-TQXULhDfEQjg5iem5wg_5-rocgp7t56y3YUOW_pX6AOtRLGqeOSPtg4ChhnNbT5vKgtbWGPVS0CRpqcjdoXM-oqZuBf58dfuip1AKI3f1lj1NMP0clMb7xPqgYjjBp3jKR3ap9jzaWlMk4OpcFzOmzRjaa-LezOd7T45mic6K7EHUGkQRA_ZfQcf70hdNpOuVWJuI5HeaXmGM98iTqyYe_2KKNBjpe0dLRl-2edej86GKPJxgDozBjyMHuoyGTyUKJ5plMuz-YgAhEaO7kdtLpnGkTmBAGJGKwwDQZa7WULzNGuY679ELAA1oTXZhpSZrvx60X2jtq43FCNtUsm7cTv\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 他说得“很厉害”这事，**方向上是真的**，但落地要拆开看。  \n你可以把 CLI-Anything 理解成：把软件变成“可被代理调用的命令接口”。\n\n## 它到底能干什么（实用版）\n1. **把 GUI 操作变成 CLI 命令**  \n   例如原来要点 10 步，现在一句命令完成。\n\n2. **给 AI 代理一个稳定可复用的执行面**  \n   比纯视觉点点点更稳定，适合重复流程。\n\n3. **结构化输出（JSON）**  \n   结果可机读，方便后续自动判断成功/失败。\n\n4. **可迭代补能力**  \n   先生成基础命令，再 refine 补齐缺口。\n\n---\n\n## 参考例子（按场景）\n### A. 文件/办公流（低风险试点首选）\n- 批量把 `docx -> pdf`\n- 批量重命名、归档、抽取目录\n- 产出：`{success_count, fail_count, failed_files}`\n\n### B. 设计/媒体流（中风险）\n- 图像批处理：统一尺寸、水印、格式转换\n- 视频批处理：抽帧、转码、拼接\n- 产出：处理日志 + 输出路径列表\n\n### C. 开发运维流（中高风险）\n- 一键跑测试、收集覆盖率、生成报告\n- 代码扫描并输出问题清单\n- 产出：`{tests_passed, tests_failed, report_url/path}`\n\n### D. 代理协同流（你最关心）\n- Agent Reach 先找资料 → CLI-Anything 批量清洗/转换 → BrowserWing 去网页提交或核验  \n- 这就是“找信息 + 处理数据 + 执行操作”的三段式流水线。\n\n---\n\n## “很厉害”背后的边界\n它不是魔法，效果取决于三件事：\n- 软件本身是否可被稳定调用\n- 命令设计是否清晰（参数、错误码、输出规范）\n- 权限边界是否收紧（白名单、确认机制）\n\n---\n\n## 你现在可以直接试的 3 个小样（建议）\n1. **批量图片转格式**（最稳）  \n2. **批量文档导出 PDF**（最实用）  \n3. **目录清单 + 元数据汇总 JSON**（最容易验收）\n\n你要的话我下一条直接给你一份：  \n**“试点任务模板（输入/输出/验收标准/回滚）”**，你照着跑 20 次就能判断它在你这是否真靠谱。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0887f7f080da81b30169b9f6990da08191885dba232645237d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":77181,"output":649,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77830,"cost":{"input":0.13506674999999999,"output":0.009086,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.14415275}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773794967978}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e4bf94b","parentId":"3edc0c16","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:50:45.300Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The entity sending untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:50] user: [08:50 AM on 18 March, 2026]: Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\", \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\" } ``` [Wed 2026-03-18 09:49 GMT+9] 他说的很厉害 都能干什么 有参考例子吗 assistant: [08:50 AM on 18 March, 2026]: [[reply_to_current]] 他说得“很厉害”这事，**方向上是真的**，但落地要拆开看。 你可以把 CLI-Anything 理解成：把软件变成“可被代理调用的命令接口”。 ## 它到底能干什么（实用版） 1. **把 GUI 操作变成 CLI 命令** 例如原来要点 10 步，现在一句命令完成。 2. **给 AI 代理一个稳定可复用的执行面** 比纯视觉点点点更稳定，适合重复流程。 3. **结构化输出（JSON）** 结果可机读，方便后续自动判断成功/失败。 4. **可迭代补能力** 先生成基础命令，再 refine 补齐缺口。 --- ## 参考例子（按场景） ### A. 文件/办公流（低风险试点首选） - 批量把 `docx -> pdf` - 批量重命名、归档、抽取目录 - 产出：`{success_count, fail_count, failed_files}` ### B. 设计/媒体流（中风险） - 图像批处理：统一尺寸、水印、格式转换 - 视频批处理：抽帧、转码、拼接 - 产出：处理日志 + 输出路径列表 ### C. 开发运维流（中高风险） - 一键跑测试、收集覆盖率、生成报告 - 代码扫描并输出问题清单 - 产出：`{tests_passed, tests_failed, report_url/path}` ### D. 代理协同流（你最关心） - Agent Reach 先找资料 → CLI-Anything 批量清洗/转换 → BrowserWing 去网页提交或核验 - 这就是“找信息 + 处理数据 + 执行操作”的三段式流水线。 --- ## “很厉害”背后的边界 它不是魔法，效果取决于三件事： - 软件本身是否可被稳定调用 - 命令设计是否清晰（参数、错误码、输出规范） - 权限边界是否收紧（白名单、确认机制） --- ## 你现在可以直接试的 3 个小样（建议） 1. **批量图片转格式**（最稳） 2. **批量文档导出 PDF**（最实用） 3. **目录清单 + 元数据汇总 JSON**（最容易验收） 你要的话我下一条直接给你一份： **“试点任务模板（输入/输出/验收标准/回滚）”**，你照着跑 20 次就能判断它在你这是否真靠谱。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] The project 'CLI-Anything' (HKUDS/CLI-Anything) on GitHub is open source, supports multi-platform integration including OpenClaw, has Chinese documentation, and is actively maintained with approximately 17.7k stars as of March 18, 2026.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] Two deployment modes are supported: cloud and local. The cloud version, '@memtensor/memos-cloud-openclaw-plugin', offers ease of use and continuous service upgrades but transmits data through the cloud. The local version, '@memtensor/memos-local-openclaw-plugin', keeps data on-device or within the internal network, providing higher control and privacy, though it requires self-deployment, maintenance, and upgrades. Users can choose based on their needs without being locked into one option.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] The user agrees to integrate CLI-Anything with a cautious, gray-scale approach: start with a low-risk workflow (e.g., file batch processing/export), use minimal permissions, require structured output (JSON), run 20–50 test cycles before scaling, and keep high-risk actions under manual confirmation.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] 用户已成功激活 Office-Automation（gog）、Self-Improving Agent（self-evolution + self-improving-agent）、skill-finder（find-skills + skill-feed）和 Skill Creator（skill-creator），所有功能均确认就绪可用。\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望进行小规模试点后再逐步放权\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于灰度接入CLI-Anything，而不是完全接入\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 09:50 GMT+9] 这个项目呢"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"timestamp":1773795045298}}
