{"type":"message","id":"452ee956","parentId":"50c03d7e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:52:39.071Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The entity sending untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The user prefers the local deployment version of OpenClaw, '@memtensor/memos-local-openclaw-plugin', which keeps data on-device or within the internal network, providing higher control and privacy, despite requiring self-deployment, maintenance, and upgrades.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] The user plans to run a low-risk proof-of-concept (PoC) for MinerU by processing 20 mixed-language PDFs (including tables), using MinerU to generate Markdown/JSON output, then applying OpenClaw for summarization and Q&A, with success metrics including parsing accuracy, table recovery rate, and answer precision.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] The user agrees to integrate CLI-Anything with a cautious, gray-scale approach: start with low-risk workflows such as batch document conversion, image processing, and automated report generation, use minimal permissions, require structured JSON output for machine readability, run 20–50 test cycles before scaling, and keep high-risk actions under manual confirmation. CLI-Anything allows converting GUI operations into CLI commands, provides a stable execution interface for AI agents, supports iterative capability enhancement, and integrates into agent collaboration pipelines where Agent Reach identifies content and CLI-Anything handles data cleaning or transformation, followed by BrowserWing for deep web operations.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] MinerU is an open-source project hosted at `opendatalab/MinerU`, has over 56k stars, shows recent active development, and is licensed under AGPL-3.0, which requires attention to compliance for commercial integration.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] The user wants to analyze their own usage habits to automatically optimize Lobster's reply style and content logic. The technical path includes behavior observation, rule extraction, automatic application, feedback adjustment, and safety boundary setting.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS API Key has been written, the gateway has restarted successfully, and the MemOS Cloud memory plugin is now available.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于本地版插件以获取更高的可控性和隐私\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于使用 MinerU 进行文档解析，认为其比 CLI-Anything 更偏向于文档解析底座。\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 09:52 GMT+9] 是开源的吗 可以本地化部署吗，如果加进我的单体测试书里面 提取详细设计书里面的内容和图片是不是更准确"}],"timestamp":1773795159070}}
