的**  \n- `opendatalab/MinerU` 是开源仓库。  \n- 许可证是 **AGPL-3.0**（商用或对外服务场景要注意合规）。\n\n2) **可以本地化部署**  \n- 可以在你本机/内网跑，不必走云端。  \n- 这点和你“高可控、重隐私”的偏好是匹配的。\n\n3) **加进你的“单体测试书”流程里，通常会更准**（尤其是详细设计书）  \n- 比普通 OCR 更强在：**版面结构、表格、章节层级、图文对应**。  \n- 对“提取详细设计书里的文本+图片”这类任务，准确率一般会明显提升，特别适合生成测试用例输入素材。  \n\n但要注意两个前提：  \n- 扫描件质量（清晰度、倾斜、噪点）会直接影响效果；  \n- 图片本身的“语义理解”还要靠后续模型（MinerU主要负责抽取与结构化）。\n\n---\n\n如果你愿意，我可以下一步直接给你一套 **“MinerU → 测试书生成”的最小落地流程**（含字段映射：章节、前置条件、步骤、预期结果、配图引用），你可以拿 20 份设计书直接做 A/B 对比。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e1d558ef3639ac30169b9f75753208191b476aec2c82776ee\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":62013,"output":434,"cacheRead":17408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79855,"cost":{"input":0.10852275,"output":0.006076,"cacheRead":0.0030464,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.11764515}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773795159071}}
{"type":"message","id":"c53e22de","parentId":"841be207","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:54:34.042Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The entity sending untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] MinerU 是开源项目，托管于 opendatalab/MinerU，许可证为 AGPL-3.0，支持本地化部署，可在本机或内网运行，符合高可控性和隐私保护需求。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] The user plans to run a low-risk proof-of-concept (PoC) for MinerU by processing 20 mixed-language PDFs (including tables), using MinerU to generate Markdown/JSON output, then applying OpenClaw for summarization and Q&A, with success metrics including parsing accuracy, table recovery rate, and answer precision.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] MinerU 能有效提取复杂文档（如详细设计书）中的文本、表格、图片及版面结构，保留章节层级、图文对应关系，适用于生成测试用例输入素材，准确率通常优于普通 OCR。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] 在单体测试书中集成 MinerU 可提升对详细设计书内容和图片的提取准确性，尤其在结构化处理、表格恢复和图文关联方面表现更优，后续仍需依赖模型进行语义理解。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:51] CLI-Anything enables the conversion of GUI operations into command-line interface (CLI) commands, while MinerU enables the transformation of complex documents into structured formats understandable by large language models. The two tools serve complementary roles in automation pipelines: MinerU handles document understanding, and CLI-Anything handles data transformation and execution.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] The user wants to analyze their own usage habits to automatically optimize Lobster's reply style and content logic. The technical path includes behavior observation, rule extraction, automatic application, feedback adjustment, and safety boundary setting.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS API Key has been written, the gateway has restarted successfully, and the MemOS Cloud memory plugin is now available.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] The user has successfully activated Office-Automation (gog), Self-Improving Agent (self-evolution + self-improving-agent), skill-finder (find-skills + skill-feed), and