esponses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":41140,"output":102,"cacheRead":17408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58650,"cost":{"input":0.071995,"output":0.001428,"cacheRead":0.0030464,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0764694}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773795274042}}
{"type":"message","id":"087ef681","parentId":"bab5517e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:54:37.692Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_YwZbKRwv5ZZDxFAgubk7WLOP|fc_060fa4785a76660c0169b9f7c8347881919232fe09c8392cd3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web unit test books from design Excel + code (zip/folder) + user template. Use when user needs template-aligned test-case generation (STEP flow style), long-term stable export behavior, and reproducible .xlsx output.\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book\n\nUse `scripts/run_pipeline.py` as the only entry.\n\n## Modes\n\n- `high-precision` (default): design + code + merge generation\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\n\n## Stable export policy (default)\n\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\n\nBehavior:\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\n\nTuning:\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\n\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `--design` design workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--code` code folder/zip (required in `high-precision`)\n- `--template` output template workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--outdir` output directory\n\n## Command\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\nTemplate-first with explicit controls:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision --export-mode template-first --data-start-row 8 --match-threshold 0.20\n```\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision)\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n\n## References\n\n- `references/knowledge-base.md`\n- `references/templates/`\n- `references/rules/`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773795277689}}
{"type":"message","id":"54dd168c","parentId":"087ef681","timestamp":"2026-03-18T00:55:00.999Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning integrated solution approach**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_060fa4785a76660c0169b9f7c999688191a0c7e7c302697f95\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuffLuL3lkA0fTKhKl7vRJ0RTtj9IbIlZ0_vsBL-i2as5qSN5voLIrC91rpDqvfCGouRhjX4yxlN9c-pgv5-xbyzHQBPMnXBnpVPlHZKsrArGu_-RKdkuRUzbt4Fhftl7TVC_hB54QCmXK5Jdg67A5mIgQAvH2KGOSH97hcVsoC3ekxInQbtm--vynylr-Ww2069yvYSGJLmIRDYtusSLtRtp1xt1O-IdTKEvc4J9yuI__2DaB1pyzP9EmGkziYVRAqxLacDWglqXYNsq_U3V-2EDqJ-ALbapIKsv6PUknIcPG-P9Z7oLxZc7ddIvLFN20TN_j4Roqn3mzGufRcojkX0e2c17GZNIQK6in5ApEq07-j8O2AnQ5S726M-EfQttXmK_iJzehTpUXT87iDw1bInZt5PHtje98Vd2t80Jl2zETXSyU1nboMQUUo22_SvXpES1rGU4l4K1Wt9nuY9Kupp-IphoKhXyiSjbwbpBWdcWALAPfgOZn9hOnjbjEnPEZ0NYfKqdKkriUee-CAgSznDIJT6jeWkfV2jwE69Ieh_cEV_4ElDYuuus4m8NHGNYnXRbjYiDEv0-R0Dc8Qd_dxW2fwcYlBE9MnKNlrRJF3bQ2T4yShvO-IAttDfQ-YrCs_VEiTlMS9BRSBSwP1IyySaveOjl9hmFeRnJ3hoSE77gQ-uxWJiapkMEb_5pJs8IuomGW5ps6X99ViPHQzvDlnAZIJwmVR2H-9i0-iC-ZhgInsjkMzk9lycncArvkDrMAkOutVxfCR4bjhpk1mSiK4kYlmkdEh88lSM1jlbIoD_cQMl-4RaJ1DgmPhL8ku6mzwEuXtTVMH9YnY5mezl2PfMtKsnWCyCOPfk5AZK__Wi2Tzu2mrHeI83uh8NAJkcu_3Y6y09NZuh4JDVy8kscQEU4xd53SdFcYQZl_kXxDdRe-ioMd81CLefrbAJNwIUZQQc__PjQVIiNM1S6_0IkCwPf0El6Ez9ME9MudR07INTxoFS5MkxYgzdCxX03HAza5Gx4pTKi_FFIp0kR95RfJ2qgCnHFbcXTFbW2no6tS127FWuU28a8plwE4rt9aXeJCA8AnzPQGFOOzBNzPdfTr6aYR8EULnlhV3bM14_Z_CZV6no=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning integrated solution approach**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好，我给你一套**在你现有“单体测试书 agent + skills”基础上，接入 MinerU 的可执行方案**。  \n目标是：**不推翻现有流程，只在输入层加一层“文档结构化增强”**，先灰度跑通。\n\n---\n\n## 0) 先定目标（你这个场景）\n你现在的核心是“从详细设计书生成单体测试书”。  \n加 MinerU 后，把流程改成：\n\n**设计书(PDF/扫描件) → MinerU结构化(JSON/MD) → 现有测试书生成管线(web-unit-testbook) → 模板导出xlsx**\n\n---\n\n## 1) 总体架构（推荐）\n### A. 输入层（新增）\n- `design_source/` 放原始详细设计书（pdf/doc图片）\n- MinerU 输出到 `parsed_design/`：\n  - `document.md`\n  - `document.json`\n  - 图片抽取目录（如 `images/`）\n  - 表格结构数据（json片段）\n\n### B. 规范层（新增轻量）\n做一个**字段映射器**（你现有 agent 可做）：\n- 章节标题 -> 功能点/测试对象\n- 前置条件关键词 -> 测试前提\n- 流程步骤列表 -> 操作步骤\n- 约束/异常说明 -> 负向测试\n- 图表引用 -> 证据/附件路径\n\n输出统一中间件：`normalized_cases_input.json`\n\n### C. 生成层（沿用）\n继续走你现有 `web-unit-testbook` 流程（这是重点）：\n- 用你现在的模板和导出规则\n- 保持 `template-first` 导出策略，稳定性最好\n\n---\n\n## 2) 与你现有 skills 的分工\n你已激活的 skills 可以这样协同：\n\n- **web-unit-testbook**：主引擎（最终生成测试书 xlsx）\n- **skill-feed / find-skills**：遇到格式/解析堵点时自动推荐补充技能\n- **self-evolution + self-improving-agent**：沉淀“你自己的生成偏好规则”（术语、粒度、步骤风格）\n- **gog**：后续做 Excel/文档批处理与分发（可选）\n\nMinerU 在这里扮演的是：**高质量文档解析底座**，不是替代生成器。\n\n---\n\n## 3) 你可以直接跑的灰度实施（3阶段）\n### Phase 1：最小PoC（20份文档）\n- 输入：20份中英混排设计书（含表格、图片）\n- 输出：结构化json + 最终测试书xlsx\n- 验收指标：\n  1. 解析成功率\n  2. 表格恢复率\n  3. 图文关联正确率\n  4. 测试步骤完整率\n  5. 预期结果可判定率\n\n### Phase 2：规则固化\n- 把高频映射规则写入 `rules/mineru_mapping_rules.json`\n- 对低质量页（扫描模糊）加“人工复核标记”字段\n\n### Phase 3：放权\n- 通过 20–50 次稳定验证后，再扩到更多项目\n- 仍保留：高风险动作人工确认（你之前定的策略）\n\n---\n\n## 4) 关键数据结构（建议）\n建议你统一一个中间格式（示意）：\n\n- `feature_id`\n- `feature_name`\n- `preconditions[]`\n- `steps[]`\n- `expected_results[]`\n- `exceptions[]`\n- `source_refs[]`（页码、章节、图片ID）\n- `confidence`（0-1）\n\n这样你后续做质量审计、回溯定位会非常稳。\n\n---\n\n## 5) 导出策略（保持你现有稳定性）\n延续 `web-unit-testbook` 的稳态策略：\n- `template-first`\n- 保留模板既有样式和固定行\n- 只填充关键字段（测试条件/想定结果）\n- 无法匹配的新增用例追加到模板数据区后\n\n这能最大化避免“每次生成格式飘”。\n\n---\n\n## 6) 风险点与对应控制\n- **AGPL-3.0合规**：若你对外商用分发/服务，先做许可证合规评估  \n- **扫描质量波动**：低清晰文档先做预处理（旋转/降噪）  \n- **图片语义不足**：MinerU负责抽取，语义解读交给后续模型  \n- **误映射**：对低置信度case打标并进入人工复核队列\n\n---\n\n## 7) 你下一步就做这3件事\n1. 我帮你定义 `normalized_cases_input.json` 标准（一次定型）  \n2. 选 20 份样本文档建立基线  \n3. 跑一轮 A/B（有 MinerU vs 无 MinerU）出对比报告\n\n---\n\n如果你同意，我下一条直接给你：\n- **可落地的目录结构**（放到你当前 workspace）\n- **字段映射规则初版**\n- **A/B 验收打分表模板**（你拿去直接评审）","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_060fa4785a76660c0169b9f7cb28b0819184b23a4072e508ff\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":617,"output":1235,"cacheRead":58496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60348,"cost":{"input":0.00107975,"output":0.01729,"cacheRead":0.010236799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02860655}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773795277693}}
