先做你那 20 份 PDF 的 PoC 验证准确率和稳定性。  \n\n如果你要，我可以下一条直接给你一个**“本地部署前检查清单（Windows版）”**，你照着一项项过就行。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00b19c9e02bdeba40169b9f8dbfcd88191a9793b6f5b91e7fc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":65316,"output":327,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65643,"cost":{"input":0.114303,"output":0.004578,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.118881}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773795548654}}
