入你的单体测试书流程）。\n\n## MinerU 本地最小落地（PoC版）\n\n### 1) 环境准备\n- Python 3.10+（建议 3.11）\n- 建议用虚拟环境（避免污染全局）\n- 准备 20 份样本 PDF（含表格/图片/中英混排）\n\n### 2) 安装（本地）\n```powershell\npython -m venv .venv\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\npython -m pip install -U pip\npip install \"mineru[all]\"\n```\n\n> 如果你机器不需要全套依赖，可先 `pip install mineru`，后续再按报错补组件。\n\n### 3) 跑最小测试\n先拿 1 份 PDF 跑通，目标是拿到：\n- markdown\n- json\n- 图片抽取目录（如有）\n\n（具体 CLI 参数名会随版本变，我建议直接先看本机帮助）\n```powershell\nmineru --help\n```\n然后按帮助里的“单文件解析”命令跑 1 个文件。\n\n### 4) 目录规范（建议）\n```text\nproject/\n  input_pdfs/\n  parsed_design/\n    <doc_name>/\n      document.md\n      document.json\n      images/\n  normalized/\n    normalized_cases_input.json\n  output/\n    unit_test_book.xlsx\n```\n\n### 5) 接入你现有 `web-unit-testbook`\n你现有主入口是：\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\n新增一层：\n- 先把 MinerU 的 `document.json/md` 转成你需要的“设计输入”\n- 再喂给现有 pipeline（保持 `template-first` 不变）\n\n### 6) 验收指标（你之前定的就很好）\n- 解析成功率\n- 表格恢复率\n- 图文关联正确率\n- 问答准确率 / 用例映射准确率\n\n---\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接给你两份可复制文件：\n1) `normalized_cases_input.json` 字段模板  \n2) `mineru_to_testbook_mapping.md` 映射规则（章节→前置条件→步骤→预期结果）  \n\n你贴上你当前测试书模板列名，我就按你的模板定制。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8bb969f0a7931b0169b9f9b7f4708191a02e6840d476f334\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":6178,"output":670,"cacheRead":44544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51392,"cost":{"input":0.0108115,"output":0.00938,"cacheRead":0.0077951999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0279867}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773795769304}}
{"type":"message","id":"524f5b14","parentId":"eecc7b81","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:03:55.587Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The entity sending untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'. The user has acknowledged and confirmed this sender in the current context.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] The user plans to run a minimal proof-of-concept for MinerU on Windows locally, using Python 3.10+, a virtual environment, and 20 mixed-language PDFs containing tables and images. The goal is to validate parsing accuracy, table recovery, image-text correlation, and expected result determinability before integrating into the existing web-unit-testbook pipeline. The user intends to use the recommended workflow: input PDF → MinerU (JSON/MD output) → existing test book generation pipeline → template-based XLSX export. The user will standardize intermediate data format with fields including feature_id, feature_name, preconditions, steps, expected_results, exceptions, source_refs, and confidence score. The user maintains a template-first export strategy, preserving original styles and layout while dynamically filling key fields. All existing activated skills—web-unit-testbook, skill-feed/find-skills, self-evolution/self-improving-agent, and gog—will continue to operate within the upgraded pipeline.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 09:53] [Implicit Preference] 用户倾向于选择高可控和重隐私的本地化解决方案\n   -[2026-03-18 09:52] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望提取详细设计书里的文本和图片\n   -[2026-03-18 09:55] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望在现有流程上加一层“文档结构化增强”，而不是推翻现有流程\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:03 GMT+9] 我的设计书是excel 不是pdf 是不是不满足"}],"timestamp":1773795835585}}
{"type":"message","id":"257a1bcb","parentId":"524f5b14","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:04:02.391Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Recommending hybrid approach**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08a2482ea03012dd0169b9f9f823248191ad91521572af073e\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpufn58CHP2R78WCoEMhbclHL_RrM2Dl3duLksUUMKM5EjgQNHmt21agGXzinyelCHe_Ox4KRmm5T8fjcxLv7a87VJJjkyiEC7IUnl0eYmD0FQRUuh8wZTNswWaI1yLxiIMQDb8rJ6SSMi73xOPeyd9kTkNWpcJzYlVXIO8X8UHjYONkZx1oU8jA22A9-Zel8_d-tHzaSE27O9wV5A9VPXPyBwHgiynaLhsWMagDFY8zXRFjI6kS_-ejR745YTnT-TIakayYB8mwXM90h3g_WrOcmQvhjpVTRDANISd6sT-OXjLf8zhXSha2G4-PgA_O4TKPbaCus9Q0LXmdDifIBWdhB46h0cdV3nazarnHfAxDX1hgN9a_Br8UZ_dtjlKuJjjL8UGNyNqGsUitKxOcLZKtXAgxuk-03xJIVr_xAhux2yymT2gZ9BLaxs3p3kKn7IXXNe-tR7LomBHuozoJnTJv5NcihJsF43ZkpZbO-PGe_Fkjj4ikAJUYpaKXSr9Yy9l0y0PHc9f8xbxhlVLDDqnkwlk4hSqMlvltXWp83tByMimucQ5DfgCXFcolFj-rXSsqIT02yvl5vhvktxZizgd8XVjuZPntVLLQ-ecbBMuhQS84yJr0GZqnlwpSYQW4Fee6_SbZ9G0SY8Lm0ZzLhbhYZtc60GyAsspXtiwc6-OKyKvVN6tAWKwWCuHsy1M4LKjKLAe-NjxBDK64dr7FHXn6cNMIIUC9NTXUIJeH7G7Vod7tKU_kFcnyDI9FqNd2T3a0SlCBES9WM3jhcwCVSPZqsqaFBhzGrJHVYtpmsyAikx5Uf3DDQyoIyWaE5bG4ku7PUE7by-F2Y6g1ve9mC_LU72MplA32PmYA7JjSGBAp5wFwFZhvIIXW5QVYAv2fFRqjVkVT5kRnnWxVsAeGJIvpnqOr4P71ZrvIbTjX3P4OlSNxu_QeLkIp024HBJRx1O_0P9GdNW-Rt9asjstdZK0-Iqkw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Recommending hybrid approach**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 不影响，**你这个场景完全满足**。  \n你设计书是 Excel，反而更省事。\n\n### 结论\n- **MinerU 主要强项是 PDF/扫描文档解析**。  \n- 你的源是 **Excel**，本身已结构化，通常**不需要先上 MinerU**。\n\n### 你该怎么做（更优）\n1) **Excel 直接进你现有 `web-unit-testbook` 流程**（主路径）  \n2) 如果设计里有截图/嵌图很多、且信息藏在图里：  \n   - 再把“图像部分”单独拿 MinerU/OCR 补提取（辅助路径）  \n3) 最后统一汇总到你定义的中间格式（feature_id / steps / expected_results 等）\n\n---\n\n所以不是“不满足”，而是：  \n**Excel 场景下，MinerU 不是刚需，是可选增强件。**\n\n你要的话我可以下一条给你一份 **“Excel主路径 + 图像补抽取”的双通道方案图**（按你现有 agent 直接能接）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a2482ea03012dd0169b9f9f8ffa88191a68ea803a80c5cec\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":7371,"output":289,"cacheRead":44416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52076,"cost":{"input":0.01289925,"output":0.004046,"cacheRead":0.0077728,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02471805}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773795835587}}
