键流程/参数/异常分支  \n- 截图文字多、人工抄写容易漏  \n- 表格是截图而不是原生单元格\n\n---\n\n## 你下一步可以直接做\n- 先拿 1 份 Excel 做 PoC：  \n  - 纯 Excel 生成一次  \n  - 再加“图片抽取补强”生成一次  \n- 对比：步骤完整率、预期结果覆盖率、漏项率。\n\n你要的话，我可以直接给你一份**“图片抽取→回填映射规则”模板**（含字段：sheet、cell_anchor、image_id、ocr_text、confidence、source_ref）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_09a2c983523d821f0169b9fa1b85648191821b6e665cf139d7\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":774,"output":396,"cacheRead":51712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52882,"cost":{"input":0.0013545,"output":0.005544,"cacheRead":0.0090496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0159481}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773795869711}}
