n**Excel 先导 PDF（每个Sheet一个PDF或整本PDF）→ MinerU提取 → 回填到你现有测试书流程。**\n\n这样基本不用改你现有 agent 主流程，只是多了一个“格式适配层”。\n\n如果你愿意，我下一条直接给你一份**Excel转PDF的防失真设置清单**（分页、缩放、打印区域、图片清晰度）避免转换后解析质量掉。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_071cb6ecd92895f50169b9fb34cb2c8191b811d1bdb4c2dda9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":53401,"output":364,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53765,"cost":{"input":0.09345175,"output":0.005096,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.09854775}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773796150215}}
