claw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:21 GMT+9] 主要图都在excel表格里 可以有效对应吗"}],"timestamp":1773796872427}}
{"type":"message","id":"4cc1dfa2","parentId":"e6e5a482","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:21:21.974Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Providing affirmative mapping answer**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0db1e6c31170570f0169b9fe050464819182412b61bb174cac\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuf4HEdGojM8CB_M-a95_AI1M3gAF8VryeFZO7FU57d212OTJ37Z6RPng-cYFfpJFN1jNpboHW3x0U6fswluBGQIZl2Od1SORn8s267FORXfCzZE3nfaJiZb8wdmSkNUYXfZCxs0BU1kLyyq1ANNqG_JimjZAEkW7ihuHR1wcFM90QWE9P75hWammKLKENJI4VQwLyZUh0p5mrIyQnGkoNyZxuyF7w53JVRTwzcUB16IEeXn5EKDVydL_na-P3sFcMPuGgq4LWi1qWtK6WXwnE8rlXHyT97U6ktPw1Eb0clG1H-cgMt6315p1CpM3hTY5u-zFr3O-BrBprMAEILVATUPNppOBAFhkZ35Bo7HD-sC0aAyfscVBkdgzFTI09MahV6-gnrwALhNc-5W08QSjadEu-8o08GeLsSp8JASaZGNGkUcfprJovfapelUg4VEHtSAeCewa4aIQdA3JfLRMhn2phdkE33XCTTNhDm49vHKuxvP41EanDZ8tdlpvi4R90RQZ5QqmCoFxKgybaVL6lpi4FjmAs0XY86OY5xn4zrhMOSvG7r66mEEvPk9Dns72w4JsibEwHAS31-tVL4LhkSuycTS6ZCfN10d7rbPBwPI7ve0ElFEfbg_NrzPfjb5j1xQvTDeHN6Qbq6-7y_vxvbEIdrcEMDCetg-eU45ylgUJbzzxTgFCArCECvXJqE0G5Jgm_lxDuWyTMtuDTj9nilfGTzX6DxwJ4Fr3p4K_9Vqluag-q0I3ywKP8ODWwetYVIJGVlsvu4N-cjrTpziBncNDPc8z1mA1anYPuxz2DPNsk8I1Z7hjEppEnz5xwY5jZ4rsvxetCDlqu7yXRNMda6kasJ9TZZViFvbPFw0VRgVvAPPqXht3PJWGcy0WaM5TJbfkTGmrhzQoAGjYyzI7UjAKFw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Providing affirmative mapping answer**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，**而且是可以做成“稳定对应”的**。  \n你这个“图在 Excel 里”的场景，关键是把“锚点”定死。\n\n## 怎么保证有效对应（核心3件事）\n\n1) **定位锚点**  \n每张图记录：\n- `sheet_name`\n- `anchor_cell`（比如 `B12`）\n- `image_id`（你自己生成唯一ID）\n- `nearby_text`（图上/图旁最近的标题或说明）\n\n2) **双重匹配**（不要只靠一个字段）  \n- 一级：`sheet_name + anchor_cell` 精确匹配  \n- 二级：`nearby_text` 语义兜底（防止插行导致锚点漂移）\n\n3) **回填时带来源**  \n每条 case 都写 `source_refs`：  \n`sheet=xx, cell=B12, image_id=img_003`  \n这样后续复核能追溯，不会“对不上图”。\n\n---\n\n## 什么时候会对不准\n- Excel 被频繁插行/删行，图片锚点变化但没重建映射  \n- 一张图对应多个功能点但没拆分  \n- 图旁说明文字缺失（只有纯截图）\n\n---\n\n## 实操建议（你现在就能用）\n- 先做一份“图片索引表”（建议单独一个 sheet）：\n  - `image_id | sheet_name | anchor_cell | nearby_text | ocr_text | confidence`\n- 规则：`confidence < 0.7` 一律人工复核，不自动入库\n\n---\n\n结论：  \n**能有效对应**，前提是你按“锚点+语义兜底+可追溯 source_refs”这套做。  \n你要的话我下一条直接给你一个可复制的 `image_map` JSON 模板。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0db1e6c31170570f0169b9fe0748e8819183a8384acc98eae8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":19638,"output":440,"cacheRead":23040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43118,"cost":{"input":0.0343665,"output":0.00616,"cacheRead":0.004032,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0445585}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773796872428}}
{"type":"message","id":"516f2ac5","parentId":"4cc1dfa2","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:22:43.180Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The source of untrusted metadata is confirmed as 'openclaw-control-ui', with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:04] The user's design book contains images embedded in Excel files, including screenshots or visual elements that require additional processing. These images must be mapped using structured fields: image_id, sheet_name, anchor_cell, ocr_text, ui_elements (such as buttons, input fields, prompts), and error_keywords (such as failure, timeout, permission, not found) to support downstream rule mapping and test case generation.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:04] MinerU is not a necessity for Excel files but can be used optionally to extract text from embedded images or screenshots.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] The user can achieve stable correspondence between images and Excel sheets by defining fixed anchors: sheet_name, anchor_cell (e.g., B12), image_id (unique identifier), and nearby_text (title or description near the image). Matching uses a two-tier approach: primary matching via sheet_name + anchor_cell, and secondary semantic fallback using nearby_text to prevent drift from insertions or deletions. Each test case must include source_refs (e.g., sheet=xx, cell=B12, image_id=img_003) for traceability. Images with OCR confidence < 0.7 require manual review and must not be automatically ingested into final test cases.  To enable parsing by MinerU, the user plans to convert Excel files to PDF, following the recommended workflow: Excel → PDF → MinerU (JSON/MD output) → existing test book generation pipeline → template-based XLSX export. This approach preserves original layout, avoids direct Excel support limitations, and maintains compatibility with the current agent pipeline.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] The user acknowledges that the current upload entry does not directly support Excel files, but understands that this limitation can be bypassed through conversion to PDF or other formats.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] 用户在单体测试书生成过程中，即使不依赖 MinerU，仍存在因图像内容无法有效提取而导致用例遗漏的问题，尤其集中在流程图分支条件、按钮状态、提示文案、错误码、表格字段约束及图文关联方面。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] Agent Reach (agent-reach) is a multi-platform content radar and extractor that specializes in searching across platforms (X, Reddit, YouTube, GitHub, Xiaohongshu, Bilibili, Weibo, etc.), retrieving article content, summarizing key points, structuring information, and performing comparative analysis of multiple sources. It also handles real browser automation tasks such as opening websites, navigating, logging in, filling forms, clicking buttons, extracting page elements, taking screenshots, and running simple JavaScript, making it suited for tasks requiring step-by-step interaction within a web environment, like exporting reports from a backend or submitting forms.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好将Excel文件转换为PDF以确保解析质量\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于使用格式转换工具以便更好地处理Excel数据\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 10:21] [Implicit Preference] 重视数据的准确性和可追溯性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 10:04] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于使用图片和文本结合的方法来增强数据提取和处理的效果\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:22 GMT+9] 不是啊 怎么可以直接拿到excel里截图的内容 你这个锚点 不行 每个文件不一样"}],"timestamp":1773796963178}}
