marked as High Risk (Snyk rating) and should be used with minimal permissions and only when necessary.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] The user maintains a template-first export strategy, preserving original styles and layout while dynamically filling key fields.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 10:04] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于使用图片和文本结合的方法来增强数据提取和处理的效果\n   -[2026-03-18 09:53] [Implicit Preference] 用户倾向于选择高可控和重隐私的本地化解决方案\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于灰度接入CLI-Anything，而不是完全接入\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:30 GMT+9] 我的设计书会跨页 有不同的内容"}],"timestamp":1773797410568}}
{"type":"message","id":"7e14a6fd","parentId":"d4718757","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:30:20.221Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Providing concise design advice**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_075a72880af52de20169ba001ebfa0819199f78e0cb9cce90b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpugAgbExfuf5-xsIEI3tlN7CnkWQxeK7KVr50Yr3xW-1nY1WA53-boUJ7VZzt8La2Vi2uGGHZa1ydYEfRCaPzZe1F8x7Zm1fcAWky2GNdUwOexZP9giCpgHb3u-txYBcPOKuGHAKH_rPqzOQEKfpFT3_HE2s2OgSGhftTT4czTVfdNO2AX952N8QFuS1CVeAjuW9K7LsZZbngcqWwzAwefAkI-RGKwQT6v2vGNdHStqkJWON7MXGq4dc8H_0qfFuNhtasQ-qQ6qPz2QalQRcEKuOjO2Jeg5185NUAAPSlaNpWqZvQdLvPkEfbLtAHRVDM9ddeHKrs5BTcXD8-GWhV6Y8P7QJjA4lEVZ06HafdrsTQlzMdJRCJPY-0C25kzv_YgYpUs0mCKOp1V4WFyDb71H8u2smXx9v_duf_NkWyNguEfdAL6DINtFN56JSI_J8g7CYWZ8Viyu4bPrbYkutSJDS37c8rP-Ast_YRWE038nEszDPdhmJo1Yx0sfhcU-Zk3ss4Li3Udwfk45BfzEys9pdXp2eor1ubOyOPEdRbpATU6g5nG24XDLOy_yeq-q92YuabiIkisOAV2jKLA0G3h2g5GTzeCtcgZrVLpfKLZMncRTU6wuubn1Wkh5vN8ljlE-REdMnXY2na8rP1OjAlmUbeH7Y37-3OWDaJaCRcJn5khIdl_jZAN7LC2E0f1ZP8UvTN53uvM_nqW0NS_ulq2UIp0QWmppE9230fRMGYHNUBDDwALlgU6FN77yxe44l7_n6_H62VzrbNETGMTpk3EJ_6CSzI4k4SnOPfPui1f40gbE2Vwh7eyDlf6T9cq1FZw_Cksix9uQUO-mZ4OfepHSHmLxrqj39GCGqhgiOoP1kyjuiCFMZ1QnfnoNTT5IHy6H2rcHk8zzBiwYI_Jhwp7TIEt4waHQixeRDAC7151FpcuJn9t0mcnNmc7egNwZeBGL9A8UkEkkdDgFTFn5jmrHlmYv5ueukoMeeX_KuGxONyAVDziZEF2NkfJecOKzUKi0kxjcb3pBqfAZdgAM6TRCaUew==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Providing concise design advice**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 完全正常，跨页+异构内容是常态。  \n你这个情况要用“**分块建模**”，不要把整本设计书当一坨处理。\n\n## 该怎么做（跨页专用）\n1) **先分页分块**  \n- 按 `Sheet / 模块标题 / 子标题` 切块  \n- 每块单独抽取：文本、表格、图片、流程\n\n2) **建立跨页链路**  \n给每块加：\n- `block_id`\n- `prev_block_id / next_block_id`\n- `section_path`（例如：登录模块>异常处理>超时）\n\n3) **做“跨页合并规则”**\n- 同一功能点在不同页出现：合并成一个 `feature_id`\n- 不同页出现同一错误码/按钮：归并到同一测试主题\n- 图在A页、说明在B页：用关键词+语义匹配拼回去\n\n4) **输出时保持可追溯**\n每条 case 必带 `source_refs[]`，可包含多个来源：\n- `sheet=xxx,row=xx`\n- `image_id=img_xxx`\n- `block_id=blk_xxx,page_span=3-5`\n\n5) **低置信度强制人工复核**\n- 跨页拼接置信度低于阈值（比如 0.7）就进 review 队列，不自动入最终书。\n\n---\n\n### 结论\n你“跨页且内容不同”**可以做**，关键是：\n- 分块处理  \n- 跨页关联  \n- 合并归一  \n- 可追溯+人工兜底  \n\n如果你愿意，我下一条直接给你一个**跨页版中间数据模板（JSON）**，你可以直接接到现有 `template-first` 流程里。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_075a72880af52de20169ba00204dc08191aa9d86f24bd3301e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1238,"output":453,"cacheRead":45056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46747,"cost":{"input":0.0021665,"output":0.0063419999999999995,"cacheRead":0.007884799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0163933}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773797410569}}
{"type":"message","id":"7285b13d","parentId":"7e14a6fd","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:33:21.157Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The source of untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] The user wants to analyze their own usage habits to automatically optimize Lobster's reply style and content logic. The technical path includes behavior observation, rule extraction, automatic application, feedback adjustment, and safety boundary setting.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] The user will standardize intermediate data format with fields including feature_id, feature_name, preconditions, steps, expected_results, exceptions, source_refs, and confidence score.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] The user can process multiple files with different content using a generalized rule-based pipeline that relies on semantic matching and rule configuration rather than fixed anchor cells. This pipeline includes xlsx unpacking to extract images from xl/media/, XML relationships in xl/drawings/ and xl/drawings/_rels/ to determine image context, visual fingerprinting (phash/dhash, dimensions, color features) for cross-file recognition, and OCR to extract ocr_text, ui_elements, error_keywords, and confidence scores. The system achieves approximately 80% automation coverage for common screenshots, flowcharts, and field explanation images. Rule configuration includes keyword dictionaries, mapping rules, and threshold policies. Complex visuals (hand-drawn, blurry, multi-page logic) and images with OCR confidence < 0.7 require manual review.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS Cloud memory plugin is available, with the API Key written and gateway restarted successfully.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:23] Each test case must include source_refs (e.g., sheet=xx, cell=B12, image_id=img_003) for traceability.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:30] The user's design book has cross-page content with different sections. To handle this, the user should use 'chunked modeling': divide by sheet/module/title, assign block_id, prev_block_id, next_block_id, section_path; merge related features across pages using semantic matching; preserve traceability via source_refs including block_id and page_span; and flag low-confidence merges (below 0.7) for manual review.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] All existing activated skills—web-unit-testbook, skill-feed/find-skills, self-evolution/self-improving-agent, and gog—will continue to operate within the upgraded pipeline.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望进行小规模试点后再逐步放权\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 09:55] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望在现有流程上加一层“文档结构化增强”，而不是推翻现有流程\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:33 GMT+9] 先把我目前的整体流程梳理一遍吧 输入是哪些内容，每一步怎么处理 用的什么skills还有技能比如ocr一类的。整体梳理一遍"}],"timestamp":1773797601155}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e9ce0b7","parentId":"7285b13d","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:33:43.806Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying current workflow and features**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_06a7f51a208738a00169ba00dd9c2c8191a4a5e9877f60a47d\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpugDfo5a4iBtQyBZwfxqns20Qgdfs5uuUBtnTiv9aAmTeFiJ_KLAiXE8iseXZy2Q_7fbAR0oPyodiN7gsJl4WRpyOijrUvthmUnaw6VbrkkXGTzWhjA3fq2JZ12_KbcDO5YDlRLaw78aPdVow-UiabVYaYKC-DUH0-KjtC0YJhMMvFrk5P0_sjAzMUM9AcNAaaqpXEdxUmo60l51LE3h1ULdA3Jzth7toWPl4dqAA5jqUbiNjyouoNEcOE-eiwRoEotqh37847oNiBpjG9Ot11XXbqew-rgZLjb5TnOWulKF6-K0EN6QWXCup2Eqx0CjgUy3j8dxpEgAHI0VZRUojuhMmouWOpKNRpZw2zoy6knGu3_CtYEfu2P_9ugfltTsqLLw21BcRE2Juy3LLC5Z-sm4Av9KS1f_cIDXWhLx8mb-Jnyz5eIcpfstRBOt10n9xXOpTIns2nk9JeMlRfJilWRB3dCUlPPLyovm1IW-iulM6T6Cwn3kbhafqTD6EyGmhu61a3kRnqnU-H9GJOSy8YXqH1kX5bIVXE_VR8cIYHjFoUlxj8NUfXAAchBsa71HM9HEmEceN1utugXsN7PXnMcxm1ZnzAn0AUNwRNGwMofj6u-4HVAnp4tN9cea8Z9aCg2pkpq7BS2Wd6Ucw6FTvfHhxP15Ub6bT08AieBrY6pBgn_U06pdXuznIap4_4C9GHRobAQIkCD_ZhpRCyNWmHzlqU4H0moorB3OHyldjPzMBRiroXabKluZqIKYkyT5YYHtASWQck-pj4Av4NvYZZGa1iNUxCu3yKkPh4C3dygJ8P6pBtWs2Ol_9f0vOWcJ2ymnSX3hbRUWiVbJ691gUm80JvjiA77683jzlUsItR1B0zr7pZYqlFLWAJwDYAaQADtZtIdGlZ6ygZERafiluSi5N74xxAAOAcA25ViFlyyeS_sMSstlHmW13_VZm2YN-G7b1o2g5Bh9hxvt1K3gR82kJLRh6UMx1g3Z0QXDDx7XphBQcFhLIE0kgExX1DwVXg4AkspFOMHA2mcDmRMf6DxZ5K9BlyGSZNRsoWALbP8kOf5hJW1BO4MAPqN0XV1j1c7cSyDgBr-QsoGZgjw1vbypuYt2lu6twgMc3rVsdvpgJM6GCkuK2LANANhH4tOVZJXfg0KU91ug3sPf507vPSHoZ5iUGT2CjchmkOrA2pD8JQ3wxLtNpOkkplCynNoniieKmyt4LQSsYwRQPKTA5Ksjqgg==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying current workflow and features**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好，我按你现在的目标，给你一版**当前整体流程全景图**（基于你现有 agent，不推翻，只增强）。\n\n---\n\n## 0) 目标\n你要做的是：  \n**从“含文本+图片、且可能跨页”的设计书，稳定生成单体测试书（template-first）**，并减少漏项。\n\n---\n\n## 1) 输入有哪些内容\n\n### A. 主输入（结构化）\n- **设计书 Excel**（核心输入）\n  - 多个 Sheet\n  - 跨页/跨模块内容\n  - 单元格文本、表格字段、约束说明\n\n### B. 辅助输入（非结构化）\n- Excel 里的**嵌入图片/截图**\n  - 流程图、UI截图、错误提示图、字段说明图\n\n### C. 模板与工程输入\n- 测试书模板（xlsx）\n- 代码目录/zip（你 high-precision 模式可用）\n\n---\n\n## 2) 整体处理流程（端到端）\n\n## Step 1：文档切块（Chunking）\n按以下粒度切块，不整本硬吃：\n- Sheet\n- 模块标题\n- 子标题/段落\n\n输出块级标识：\n- `block_id`\n- `section_path`\n- `prev_block_id` / `next_block_id`\n\n---\n\n## Step 2：Excel文本主通道抽取\n从单元格/表格抽：\n- 功能描述\n- 前置条件\n- 操作步骤草稿\n- 约束（长度/枚举/必填）\n- 异常说明\n\n---\n\n## Step 3：图片通道抽取（OCR/视觉）\n从 xlsx 解包获取图片（`xl/media` + drawings 关系）后，对每张图做：\n- OCR 文本（`ocr_text`）\n- UI 元素（按钮/输入框/提示）\n- 错误关键词（失败/超时/权限/不存在）\n- 置信度（`confidence`）\n\n> 这里 OCR 能力可以用你选定的引擎（MinerU 可选增强，不是 Excel 场景刚需）。\n\n---\n\n## Step 4：图文融合映射（关键）\n把文本通道 + 图片通道合并到统一语义：\n- 生成/补全：`preconditions / steps / expected_results / exceptions`\n- 通过语义匹配做跨页归并（不是靠固定锚点）\n\n---\n\n## Step 5：统一中间格式\n落到你定义的数据结构（你这个很正确）：\n- `feature_id`\n- `feature_name`\n- `preconditions`\n- `steps`\n- `expected_results`\n- `exceptions`\n- `source_refs`\n- `confidence`\n\n---\n\n## Step 6：质量门控（防漏、防幻觉）\n规则：\n- `confidence < 0.7` → 人工复核，不进最终书\n- 跨页合并低置信度 → review 队列\n- 每条 case 必须带 `source_refs`（可追溯）\n\n---\n\n## Step 7：测试书生成导出\n进入现有 `web-unit-testbook` 主流程：\n- `run_pipeline.py`\n- `mode=high-precision`（如需代码融合）\n- `export-mode=template-first`（你当前稳定策略）\n\n输出：\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n\n---\n\n## 3) 你现在在用/可用的 skills（按职责）\n\n- **web-unit-testbook**：主生成引擎（核心）\n- **skill-feed / find-skills**：流程卡点时推荐补技能\n- **self-evolution / self-improving-agent**：沉淀你的风格与规则，持续优化\n- **gog**：Office/表格相关自动化辅助\n- **BrowserWing**（偏浏览器自动化）\n- **Agent Reach**（偏跨平台检索/提取）\n\n---\n\n## 4) OCR/图像类能力在你流程里的位置\n你现在最缺的是这一层（也是漏项根因）：\n**图片内容结构化 → 用例字段映射规则**\n\n不是单纯“有没有 OCR”，而是：\n- OCR结果如何转 steps/expected/exceptions\n- 怎么做跨页归并\n- 怎么做低置信度拦截\n\n---\n\n## 5) 当前你这套流程的强项与短板\n\n### 强项\n- 主流程已经成熟（template-first + 可复现导出）\n- 结构化输入（Excel）本身有利于稳定生成\n\n### 短板\n- 图片语义转 case 的桥接规则不完整\n- 跨页异构内容容易丢分支/异常路径\n\n---\n\n如果你同意，我下一步可以直接给你两份“可落地工件”：\n1) **跨页中间数据 JSON 模板**  \n2) **图片内容→测试字段映射规则 v1（可直接塞到你现有流水线）**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_06a7f51a208738a00169ba00df15488191a7f9542b92d23a36\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1387,"output":1174,"cacheRead":46208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48769,"cost":{"input":0.00242725,"output":0.016436,"cacheRead":0.008086399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02694965}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773797601157}}
{"type":"message","id":"18187b65","parentId":"0e9ce0b7","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:41:57.093Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-18 10:41:17 GMT+9] WhatsApp gateway connected.\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:41 GMT+9] 其实测试书模板（xlsx） 后续也可能会多sheet，代码目录/zip 这边 是辅助设计书内容来填观点。不是重要的case观点。"}],"timestamp":1773798117090}}
{"type":"message","id":"96771b1e","parentId":"18187b65","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:42:07.857Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**确认架构调整**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0e6a85077fefce250169ba02e3615081918385077ccc745e1f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpugLkBpfG3u_ITqFZAfG3PZY3wFJWQ-Nm2H65IRninMWXiqdk9UYzt9ZfvdL0dIeUnsHHUphoTvjsiKu7eXLjcpFdUNzhGfvmeTio9gTQt9yvBZ73KuHdh8CNcx_wOhWmwWPGyTxgFv_1MGVepfbg50369d0Fbijug9rMIh_pHENxUuGNlzT8qETGPh6zwIcdSgF2BoEwMeNWERnPJUCdUOhhhUykkw1WC3XG5bGufjrg2ry-dNRzP3TEehDPb3Sjdhtz9scH85LvvjSQeT2PkigVYRDMdf_Dax5ANR6ty3yoFAzgLNmWhdPmOyTANl0CwK0FaaOLTfyPLnb5cFHxAw23J8BqZe_-bYqfCbvSdxcUtNS_ecJGJ6Qt4_hPV_99SoDabRd09pb4Dk-yoakkj0EwiaBnAR81qY8050fbG_j4_9OnXERqEWv2TFv5Cpn2Y0Tsn2oLxhAIiNCvIlRoaBx1OjOQMz9RZUYFlrFFXgDDEZK9h5dH689n6G3_E4EZN6zVwea8Qy_i3O_oFllfmJCwTgUxJIKwyUVCgPPEIYEgtjol4YU6gKNCDNb3gJXKt2OSUQ9-_FHVt5enAK24qhLIaEHlqM6RIj4_f548YK78FPlUf78j9z5Xgs3vfHD_qPNOAgF08BYPncJ0qsRpIcDGxN8eK6V8OklSjCFMWi9rQZMUeNFZYmVlEpG6qxTplihq8QG408uoxsdkff73sbKr20CBEODA4T-aHq63o4J8LrL4KTiT3uxfUHcwnT04Vz88PR76T8AXR4pVIGXYnhCkxJDUEled_WH4suTbjRUurw-Y5ZlLnG_eu9Ak3-D7HuO6vstkJbEzc4VPjguh41M956yJK9PysWG8Cg27CFGNM5_hucpXfn2hX7_00fgUcWvF5p1OTikIAZRz-Pq4vQOgK2V2TlN3wqLNJHxCMjlX5qWcdA9k4OC7FdMd1mcyy96AQYOXpVHTMLvPCXACx5Du9EKmUM01tJpceoSFbp0Y0BS4aWGKKSeDkaaXaE_dmwN1ROlN4VCj11MvAQhWsfEpBKdY50-OdOqS2TJb-y1Kkl4=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**确认架构调整**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 明白，这个定位非常关键。你这句话等于把“主次关系”定准了：\n\n## 你现在的正确主线\n1) **设计书（Excel + 图片）是 case 观点主来源**  \n2) **代码目录/zip 只是辅助校验与补充**（不是决定 case 观点）  \n3) **测试书模板 xlsx 未来可能多 Sheet**，生成要支持多页签映射\n\n---\n\n那流程我建议你改成这个优先级：\n\n### A. Case主生成（Design-First）\n- 从设计书抽取功能点/步骤/预期/异常  \n- 图片信息参与补强（尤其异常、状态、提示文案）\n\n### B. Code辅助校验（Code-Assist）\n- 仅用于：\n  - 补字段约束（长度、枚举、必填）\n  - 校对术语/接口名\n  - 发现设计与实现不一致（作为“审计提示”）\n- **不直接改写 case 主观点**\n\n### C. 模板多Sheet输出（Template-MultiSheet）\n- 按模块/子系统把 case 分发到对应 sheet\n- 保持 template-first，不破坏原格式\n\n---\n\n## 这样做的好处\n- 不会被代码“带偏”测试视角  \n- case 更贴业务与设计意图  \n- 多 Sheet 模板扩展时更稳，不会全挤在一个页签里\n\n---\n\n如果你点头，我下一条就给你：\n**“多Sheet模板映射规则 v1”**（含：`feature -> target_sheet`、找不到sheet时的fallback、跨页case拆分规则）。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e6a85077fefce250169ba02e46bf88191a4d9afb1605ab9c1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":45680,"output":413,"cacheRead":2560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48653,"cost":{"input":0.07994,"output":0.005782,"cacheRead":0.000448,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.08617}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773798117092}}
{"type":"message","id":"27ea00bb","parentId":"96771b1e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:45:24.475Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:45 GMT+9] 那我这边这一堆skills 是不是需要修改了 。调用三省六部 帮我讨论一下 在现有的基础上怎么修改 先提方案。不修改"}],"timestamp":1773798324472}}
