{"type":"message","id":"1f2cbe71","parentId":"9daf7b42","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:45:52.473Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Summarizing scheme tiers**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08419eae021181ce0169ba03bcbd1c8191a200beec5b731822\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpugO94-D35yDNzy-mtNDU36M3FVuyx2ylW5jHNRnMO6_Q1spQyvfoYP0q1mpZM4Dv-EfhFR-EdGTi7Lhc0ily8jwT0kKFprHYk3jHEntRANDoEixGBhobVMnKggTnhqsyqh2GZ8PUqEjQ1tUS_kF6047jPxBAuT0Ft4oFFcMb635PT61NBahG8UG3UEuJj2BOl-PSeDSBZOJoCDrT6ht8n6tlQCL0Z7P7F9wGHtNVR2LdG8MPzYhDAPx1Y60afFI6HbHWFrVRUgrwDMuW3_eE8BDw7IDF_E0sL0T7_4P_9722WM24cWdLhqCgqTNTvtEfxzTnifHEhMA_TzGFjpxIRnW5Cj8X38O-NMig8SkI-s2YPxrNdcy4hxUzWXBQF147qDqMq3z1xZrLflxlViNXtgo9Pz0tklngIIdq-1jQCbgduKOY_I0QMTd91gic2I2JCUBBQngyjxPD3wZF9L7bUcEGzuE-3VGYvOjzNqcEfCQECLumF3fnFLvHuLDXR3ENWaVO9rB-lkfOlkxWcBKOKgBe6xrd1YnKvoAYObUGjPZAk4SBreMm4Q27uou9qMyCQECKRxA_kQZCQP5dTo1apGyicCiRFWcwUCRqgurrOp2JBMEvVKkWU9YOc2RrbF8hI8tKJqxO9N63cE8xB-XHhlolSbnmJjZlds6KiHCiWlEAJ5sthAiFGvttx4cWHVImURtheFrnAB5kFkkOQn_WB5zgtxRUjkBqPo1Y1woy1Ofb3OQUOMiALbuKEbByge1Hrd7advY5_MI6oX-Q3WmWQhph1HKRL5CZB1qiT7lIKECFDYilXpuDBY8CZyzn0238l9oQRNnaFTUk7X-O-hpy9b4I4OHW6vWO0AKqKQRdlrRdbaAOZIvCgENBrBjmjgkX8TLy4JrhHHfh-MJuQtsU3IBR4zt8IDPPkTYkp-FZDfYa7FuVJ1_LZJ0bp7GgN6u9PZ9logohwiGM6WxOMilLVeirSl4nOdmOu1pXsu9N7Ouxpu_NEzie0tN0V5yz67adPtU7YkiccfHy781Klzhbz4BU1rGEDlT97NiY0WIpNo7YSckWbS4qJmniCA4rcrBWSJKyvjM3xz7A208v6gwHttfiyNf6tctxO3FAMXa0TTUe2jMo98CoEoWz2S8RGMNha59Q\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Summarizing scheme tiers**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好，这里给你一版“**三省六部讨论后的方案草案**”（只提方案，不改任何东西）。\n\n我先说结论：  \n**你这堆 skills 不用大改，做“分层重排 + 两个补位能力”就够了。**\n\n---\n\n## 一、先定现状问题（你现在的卡点）\n不是生成主链有问题，而是这两段断层：\n\n1) **图片内容抽出来了，但没稳定映射到 case 字段**  \n2) **代码辅助权重容易过高，可能带偏设计视角**\n\n---\n\n## 二、建议的技能分层（不删，只重排职责）\n\n### P0 核心主链（必须保留）\n- `web-unit-testbook`：最终生成与导出（template-first）\n- 你的中间格式规则（feature_id / steps / expected / source_refs / confidence）\n\n### P1 文档增强层（新增能力位，不一定立刻装）\n- OCR/图像结构化能力（可用 MinerU 或其他 OCR 组件）\n- 目标：把 Excel 内截图转成结构化字段（ui_elements/error_keywords）\n\n### P2 质量与策略层（你已具备）\n- `self-evolution` + `self-improving-agent`：持续优化映射规则\n- `skill-feed/find-skills`：遇到解析瓶颈时补技能建议\n\n### P3 辅助层（降权）\n- `gog`：文档处理/批处理辅助\n- 代码目录/zip：只做校验，不主导 case 观点\n\n---\n\n## 三、三省六部式“职责编排”建议（逻辑版）\n你可以把后续执行按这几个“部门职责”理解：\n\n- **中书省（规划）**：拆分输入、定义映射规则与置信度阈值  \n- **门下省（审核）**：低置信度与跨页合并冲突审核  \n- **尚书省（执行）**：调用生成链落地 xlsx\n\n六部可对应：\n- 吏部：规则版本管理  \n- 户部：样本与覆盖率统计  \n- 礼部：模板规范一致性  \n- 兵部：异常/负向用例压测  \n- 刑部：错误映射审计  \n- 工部：流水线脚本化与性能优化\n\n---\n\n## 四、要不要“修改 skills”？\n**短答：现在先不用改技能包本身。**  \n先做这三件“配置级改造”更值：\n\n1) 增加一份 `image_to_case_mapping_rules`（规则文件）  \n2) 增加 `confidence gate`（<0.7 必审）  \n3) 增加多 sheet 路由策略（feature→sheet）\n\n---\n\n## 五、分阶段推进（先方案，不动系统）\n- **第1阶段（1周）**：只补规则，不加新依赖，跑 10~20 份样本  \n- **第2阶段**：再决定是否引入 MinerU 作为 OCR 增强  \n- **第3阶段**：稳定后再考虑把“审核环节”半自动化\n\n---\n\n如果你认这个方向，我下一条就给你：  \n**《现有 skills 最小调整清单（按优先级 P0/P1/P2）》**，每条都带“收益/风险/是否立刻做”。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08419eae021181ce0169ba03bdfbf88191b1e57ded9d2d67e4\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":878,"output":816,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52382,"cost":{"input":0.0015364999999999999,"output":0.011424,"cacheRead":0.008870399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0218309}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773798336398}}
{"type":"message","id":"2ee186fc","parentId":"1f2cbe71","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:48:20.059Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The source of untrusted metadata is 'openclaw-control-ui' with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui'.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] The user wants to analyze their own usage habits to automatically optimize Lobster's reply style and content logic. The technical path includes behavior observation, rule extraction, automatic application, feedback adjustment, and safety boundary setting.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] All existing activated skills—web-unit-testbook, skill-feed/find-skills, self-evolution/self-improving-agent, and gog—will continue to operate within the upgraded pipeline.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:30] The user's design book has cross-page content with different sections. To handle this, the user should use 'chunked modeling': divide by sheet/module/title, assign block_id, prev_block_id, next_block_id, section_path; merge related features across pages using semantic matching; preserve traceability via source_refs including block_id and page_span; and flag low-confidence merges (below 0.7) for manual review.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] The user will standardize intermediate data format with fields including feature_id, feature_name, preconditions, steps, expected_results, exceptions, source_refs, and confidence score.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] The user can process multiple files with different content using a generalized rule-based pipeline that relies on semantic matching and rule configuration rather than fixed anchor cells. This pipeline includes xlsx unpacking to extract images from xl/media/, XML relationships in xl/drawings/ and xl/drawings/_rels/ to determine image context, visual fingerprinting (phash/dhash, dimensions, color features) for cross-file recognition, and OCR to extract ocr_text, ui_elements, error_keywords, and confidence scores. The system achieves approximately 80% automation coverage for common screenshots, flowcharts, and field explanation images. Rule configuration includes keyword dictionaries, mapping rules, and threshold policies. Complex visuals (hand-drawn, blurry, multi-page logic) and images with OCR confidence < 0.7 require manual review.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:23] Each test case must include source_refs (e.g., sheet=xx, cell=B12, image_id=img_003) for traceability.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] The user is aware that BrowserWing and Agent Reach are marked as High Risk (Snyk rating) and should be used with minimal permissions and only when necessary.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS Cloud memory plugin is available, with the API Key written and gateway restarted successfully.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:38] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望在提问时自动匹配并调用合适的技能\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] [Implicit Preference] 希望提高自己在测试用例设计中的技能，特别是在图片内容的抽取和映射规则方面\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:53] [Implicit Preference] 用户倾向于选择高可控和重隐私的本地化解决方案\n   -[2026-03-18 09:36] [Explicit Preference] Install Office-Automation, Self-Improving Agent, skill-finder, and Skill Creator.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:55] [Explicit Preference] The user wants a solution that includes MinerU.\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 10:48 GMT+9] 不是用三省六部来做这个skills 是让他们来讨论 在我现在的单体测试书agent的基础上 怎么进行修改 要增加什么技能 skills整体梳理。"}],"timestamp":1773798500056}}
{"type":"message","id":"dacc5fcb","parentId":"2ee186fc","timestamp":"2026-03-18T01:48:45.938Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02062baf3a876c2b0169ba0466c0708191a6b899bb68bdacab\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpugRn6d72Nn_lyjUiSRSKRHur2KsGVqzlbhnA5Cv4123ZwufcIsNX3i5Mf1kczY7KdyTvwRq8SqH_qD5av7Ub-FJ_u5ppssp7Vw0_jeZkEW5Fvv5_hA49a99hawowYeoEHAIlvaSXQF2O6UdNqPp_goted8vzzQvvQtqZGGhfgUPqLyLldYJI7OFWLkujrT4HVRghIQ05BDfGBZbO9didHFbXJTBAY8V2R7h1IJqAdsYnvfcCi8AMle2N0-hX9JDvyEqJ-_XZ0mnzXjb0-jsUD9rVMWxDj4V1kWATTQnKxY7lGgAdtPE-plsAjOPUuILu_e79MQndt4dgUPOdVd6QPIRczNDLTc2IaUB7vam6Ks_gvZjfSMBUS7ApHzb5a0NsAtkBMFJWo74IDw8a53V58lGJtmjoGT3w6PxoqyVQslZ1EPHxeG4P1-wWWRNPkosWnyjLl71HaMOKyhOPvMIvAjTCmom9Dqj2OWIckFEnxXYUKcndxljZPnONgsiUyl5mBpCkhu5gaMxGyKapQcvwmG5O_xpg2_fvITVpw-DiZD6yvunuCufpXaLGBYMd4c4uLeCLweKh4lkUnkwFSwXNgphP4dxe3tAiOS_DZP7kIx5EnL7f68GMgzJFQ9moVAY45ss71srDUQn52slE2jUuDVVpRaOzcwry-q5vMvPe57YPr-tI5dUfhDbQYSSaelK8X_c3n_ZAYkW2q0_ZwDb6d0e-kslb5GR6H8RkZ2EGJ4s_L_Jl-8sJ4wiIwrMZzwjTVTkZ-KKRICLeKYWNcFy1P7QpXV48y_iBHW-zbJzkViuK1p2q9KQWBornbn0K7FJl4sjRtiitTt6EjGvd_Xn_YbwcJAR-hgucggBhw7mw5U9-mBS4t8D8PJZl-Hcl76HcF6hsa6C6WkpKPxqcfdUknCFWxso-1BVwbc4xIncbME17c0pQiR6zi6-10G8IkDijcIZuJK3epHTMWPKz_mgZ6ZKIdMkkTZSPMxqcK57tYgo5BZmF6fRLx_TSsLYBCtfsPtji70UOazMbQRW_RzYnvOmnk2I0-mGh9yp52386FihyD0JZcfZuNcl_G4FRWItkneByKgwVThvGXulgYYjsJ_m4bQ==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 明白了，你的意思是：**让“三省六部”当评审团**，不是让它来执行。  \n那我给你一个“评审结论版”的**技能改造方案（基于你现有单体测试书 agent）**。\n\n---\n\n## 0) 现有基础（保留不动）\n你已有：\n- `web-unit-testbook`（主引擎）\n- `self-evolution` / `self-improving-agent`（持续优化）\n- `find-skills` / `skill-feed`（补能力发现）\n- `gog`（办公自动化辅助）\n\n这个底座够用，不推翻。\n\n---\n\n## 1) 三省六部“讨论结论”（方案层）\n\n### 中书省（架构结论）\n你的主链应是 **Design-First**：\n1. 设计书 Excel（主）\n2. 图片语义抽取（补强）\n3. 中间结构化（统一 schema）\n4. 模板导出（多 sheet）\n\n代码目录/zip只做“校验与补充”，不主导 case 观点。\n\n---\n\n### 门下省（风控结论）\n必须新增两道门：\n1. **置信度闸门**：`confidence < 0.7` 必审，不入最终书  \n2. **可追溯强制**：每条 case 必带 `source_refs[]`\n\n---\n\n### 尚书省（执行结论）\n你要加的是“能力模块”，不是重装一堆技能。优先级如下：\n\n#### P0（立刻补，最关键）\n- **image-to-case 映射规则层**（你现在最缺）\n  - 把 OCR/ui_elements/error_keywords 映射到：\n  - `preconditions / steps / expected_results / exceptions`\n\n#### P1（建议新增）\n- **Excel 嵌图抽取器**（xlsx 解包 + drawings 关系）\n- **OCR/视觉解析器**（MinerU 可作为其中一个实现）\n- **跨页语义合并器**（block_id / section_path / page_span）\n\n#### P2（可后置）\n- **冲突审计器**（设计 vs 代码差异报告）\n- **多sheet路由器**（feature -> target_sheet）\n\n---\n\n## 2) 你到底“要增加哪些 skills”？\n不是盲目加很多，而是补 3 类能力：\n\n1) **文档视觉抽取类 skill（必补）**  \n- 目标：拿到 Excel 内截图可用结构\n\n2) **映射规则执行类 skill（必补）**  \n- 目标：让图片内容能写进 case，不再只停在 OCR 文本\n\n3) **质量审计类 skill（强烈建议）**  \n- 目标：低置信度和跨页冲突自动拦截\n\n> MinerU：放在“视觉抽取实现层”，是可选强实现，不是唯一依赖。\n\n---\n\n## 3) 你现有 skills 的“保留/调整/新增”清单\n\n### 保留\n- web-unit-testbook（核心）\n- self-evolution + self-improving-agent（规则迭代）\n- skill-feed/find-skills（缺口补齐）\n- gog（批处理辅助）\n\n### 调整（配置层）\n- 把 code 输入权重下调为“辅助证据”\n- 输出前强制 confidence gate\n- 模板导出支持多 sheet 路由规则\n\n### 新增（能力层）\n- Excel 图片抽取 + OCR skill（可对接 MinerU）\n- image→case 映射 skill（规则引擎）\n- 跨页合并/冲突审计 skill\n\n---\n\n## 4) 建议落地节奏（先方案，不改系统）\n- 第1步：只加“映射规则 + 置信度闸门”\n- 第2步：接入图片抽取/OCR（MinerU可接）\n- 第3步：做跨页合并和多sheet路由\n- 第4步：再做设计-代码差异审计\n\n---\n\n如果你同意，我下一条给你一个**可执行的“最小改造蓝图”**：  \n按 `本周可做 / 下周可做 / 暂不做` 三栏列出来，并附每项预期收益。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02062baf3a876c2b0169ba0467c0908191adaf534868d0a682\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":32255,"output":1000,"cacheRead":16768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50023,"cost":{"input":0.056446249999999996,"output":0.014,"cacheRead":0.0029343999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.07338065}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773798500059}}
