{"type":"message","id":"bd97134e","parentId":"c742e0c5","timestamp":"2026-03-18T03:45:31.415Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_pxUqcYrl8U82FQjXJ4gTwOCJ|fc_040a3218365109a50169ba1fd602888191aaabdd8eeb6aa813","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web unit test books from design Excel + code (zip/folder) + user template. Use when user needs template-aligned test-case generation (STEP flow style), long-term stable export behavior, and reproducible .xlsx output.\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book\n\nUse `scripts/run_pipeline.py` as the only entry.\n\n## Modes\n\n- `high-precision` (default): design + code + merge generation\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\n\n## Stable export policy (default)\n\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\n\nBehavior:\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\n\nTuning:\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\n\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `--design` design workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--code` code folder/zip (required in `high-precision`)\n- `--template` output template workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--outdir` output directory\n\n## Command\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision\n```\n\nTemplate-first with explicit controls:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision --export-mode template-first --data-start-row 8 --match-threshold 0.20\n```\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision)\n- `cases.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n\n## References\n\n- `references/knowledge-base.md`\n- `references/templates/`\n- `references/rules/`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773805531410}}
