ired)\n- Normalize terminology to implementation naming\n- Detect design-vs-code conflicts and output audit notes\n\n## Disallowed code-assist usage\n- Rewriting core test intention derived from design\n- Deleting design-derived negative paths only because code path is absent\n- Overriding expected_results without explicit design evidence\n\n## Required output metadata\nEach generated case must include:\n- `source_refs[]` (design refs required; code refs optional)\n- `confidence`\n\n## Gate conditions\n- `confidence < 0.70` => manual review required\n- Missing `source_refs` => block final export in strict mode\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\rules\\\\design-first-code-assist-policy.md\",\"content\":\"# Design-First / Code-Assist Policy\\n\\n## Objective\\nKeep test-case viewpoints anchored in design intent while using code as supporting evidence only.\\n\\n## Priority\\n1. **Design evidence (primary)**: design Excel text/tables/images\\n2. **Code evidence (secondary)**: constraints/implementation hints/conflict checks\\n\\n## Allowed code-assist usage\\n- Fill missing field constraints (length/range/enum/required)\\n- Normalize terminology to implementation naming\\n- Detect design-vs-code conflicts and output audit notes\\n\\n## Disallowed code-assist usage\\n- Rewriting core test intention derived from design\\n- Deleting design-derived negative paths only because code path is absent\\n- Overriding expected_results without explicit design evidence\\n\\n## Required output metadata\\nEach generated case must include:\\n- `source_refs[]` (design refs required; code refs optional)\\n- `confidence`\\n\\n## Gate conditions\\n- `confidence < 0.70` => manual review required\\n- Missing `source_refs` => block final export in strict mode\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":9950,"output":284,"cacheRead":61696,"