on`\n\n2) **主流水线接入门禁**\n- 更新：`skills/web-unit-testbook/scripts/run_pipeline.py`\n- 新参数：\n  - `--quality-gate off|warn|fail`（默认 warn）\n  - `--min-confidence 0.70`（默认）\n- 生成 `cases.json` 后会先跑门禁，再导出 Excel\n\n3) **P0 规则文件落地**\n- 新增：`references/rules/design-first-code-assist-policy.md`\n- 新增：`references/rules/image-to-case-mapping-rules-v1.yaml`\n\n4) **技能说明更新**\n- 更新：`skills/web-unit-testbook/SKILL.md`\n- 已补充质量门禁参数、输出、规则引用\n\n---\n\n### 已提交 commit\n`da33e5f`  \n`web-unit-testbook: add P0 quality gate and design-first mapping rules`\n\n---\n\n如果你确认，我下一步就继续做 **P0 剩余项**（直接动手）：\n- `source_refs` 字段结构校验细化（不仅“有”，还校验格式）\n- 多 sheet 路由规则 v1（feature -> sheet）\n- 20 份样本验收打分表（可直接拿来试点）","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_040a3218365109a50169ba2059e898819187c4eb2d6045fe07\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":239,"output":473,"cacheRead":75008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75720,"cost":{"input":0.00041825,"output":0.006622,"cacheRead":0.0131264,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02016665}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773805657877}}
