d, including fields: feature_id, feature_name, preconditions, steps, expected_results, exceptions, source_refs, and confidence score.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] The system can process multi-file content through a general rule engine, supports xlsx unpacking to extract images, parses XML relationships to determine image context, performs visual fingerprint matching (phash/dhash, size, color features), and conducts OCR to extract ocr_text, ui_elements, error_keywords, and confidence scores. It achieves approximately 80% automation coverage for common screenshots, flowcharts, and field description diagrams. Complex images (hand-drawn, blurry, cross-page logic) and those with confidence < 0.7 require manual review.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 11:31] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于生成质量稳定且漏项可控的生产级体系\n   -[2026-03-18 12:44] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于接受建议并希望获得具体的可执行方案\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 13:13 GMT+9] p0剩余也做完了吗"}],"timestamp":1773807237771}}
