示例。\n\n---\n\n### 验证结果\n- `quality_gate_cases.py --help` 正常，出现 `--strict-source-refs`。\n- 用现有样本跑过一轮，报告正常生成，严格校验生效。\n\n---\n\n### 代码提交\n- 已提交：`d6fd590`\n- 提交信息：`web-unit-testbook: tighten P0 source_refs schema validation`\n\n---\n\n现在状态：**P0 我这边认定已收尾完成**。  \n你要的话我下一步就直接给你一版“问题最多的前20条 case 清单 + 对应修复建议规则”，把 warn 数量再压一轮。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0901a5004ef7d5000169ba28085d2c81919c66b66a388d369d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":318,"output":461,"cacheRead":47872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48651,"cost":{"input":0.0005565,"output":0.006454,"cacheRead":0.008377599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.015388099999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773807627293}}
{"type":"message","id":"384367c9","parentId":"6c074652","timestamp":"2026-03-18T04:21:46.116Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The system identifies 'openclaw-control-ui' as an untrusted metadata source with identifier 'openclaw-control-ui', and this classification remains valid under current security policies.\n   -[2026-03-18 11:33] The quality gate script 'quality_gate_cases.py' is now active in the web-unit-testbook pipeline, checking for missing or low-confidence source_refs (confidence < 0.7), supporting 'off', 'warn', or 'fail' modes, generating a 'quality_report.json' output, and using '--quality-gate' and '--min-confidence 0.70' parameters with default behavior set to warn.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] 用户希望基于自身使用习惯，通过行为观察、规则提取、自动应用、反馈调整和安全边界设置，实现Lobster回复风格与内容逻辑的自动优化。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS Cloud memory plugin is available, with the API Key configured and gateway restarted successfully.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] The system can process multi-file content through a general rule engine, supports xlsx unpacking to extract images, parses XML relationships to determine image context, performs visual fingerprint matching (phash/dhash, size, color features), and conducts OCR to extract ocr_text, ui_elements, error_keywords, and confidence scores. It achieves approximately 80% automation coverage for common screenshots, flowcharts, and field description diagrams. Complex images (hand-drawn, blurry, cross-page logic) and those with confidence < 0.7 require manual review.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:52] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于高可控和重隐私的本地化部署\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 12:44] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于接受建议并希望获得具体的可执行方案\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于使用格式转