, performs visual fingerprint matching (phash/dhash, size, color features), and conducts OCR to extract ocr_text, ui_elements, error_keywords, and confidence scores. It achieves approximately 80% automation coverage for common screenshots, flowcharts, and field description diagrams. Complex images (hand-drawn, blurry, cross-page logic) and those with confidence < 0.7 require manual review.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:23] Each test case must include source_refs with detailed references such as sheet name, cell address, image ID, block ID, and page span for full traceability.\n   -[2026-03-18 11:33] Implementation will proceed in three phases over 2, 4, and 8 weeks respectively, focusing first on rule and gate deployment, then on OCR and extraction, then on intelligent routing and auditing. Each phase requires documented acceptance metrics before progression.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 13:22] [Implicit Preference] 希望通过调整置信度来改善问题分类的质量\n   -[2026-03-18 09:40] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好使用BrowserWing浏览器\n   -[2026-03-18 13:20] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于精确和严格的质量控制\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 13:24 GMT+9] 你测的什么数据 怎么有213个case"}],"timestamp":1773807847965}}
