gn book UI content** (text/tables/images/OCR).\n- Code is **verify-only** for UI-facing assertions (error wording / navigation hints).\n- Do **not** expand case count by internal code `if/else` branch coverage.\n- Generated cases include verification markers:\n  - `error_message_verified_by_code`\n  - `navigation_verified_by_code`\n  - `code_refs[]`\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\SKILL.md\",\"old_string\":\"## Modes\\n\\n- `high-precision` (default): design + code + merge generation\\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\\n\",\"new_string\":\"## Modes\\n\\n- `high-precision` (default): UI-first generation from design + code-assisted verification metadata\\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\\n\\n## UI-first rule (enforced)\\n\\n- Case source is **design book UI content** (text/tables/images/OCR).\\n- Code is **verify-only** for UI-facing assertions (error wording / navigation hints).\\n- Do **not** expand case count by internal code `if/else` branch coverage.\\n- Generated cases include verification markers:\\n  - `error_message_verified_by_code`\\n  - `navigation_verified_by_code`\\n  - `code_refs[]`\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":187,"output":241,"cacheRead":57088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57516,"cost":{"input":0.00032725,"output":0.003374,"cacheRead":0.0099904,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01369165}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773811766218}}
