e approach to better match the expected format.\n   -[2026-03-18 11:33] The image-to-case mapping rules v1 have been successfully deployed via 'image-to-case-mapping-rules-v1.yaml'. This rule set enables automated case generation from images based on visual fingerprint matching, OCR recognition, and contextual analysis, with cases below confidence < 0.7 requiring manual review.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 09:52] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好于高可控和重隐私的本地化部署\n   -[2026-03-18 13:22] [Implicit Preference] 希望通过调整置信度来改善问题分类的质量\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:47] [Implicit Preference] 对开源项目和技术集成有较高的兴趣和需求\n   -[2026-03-18 13:20] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于精确和严格的质量控制\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSystem: [2026-03-18 17:06:21 GMT+9] WhatsApp gateway connected.\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 17:09 GMT+9] 正常系参考我的单体测试书模板 看看它怎么写的，"}],"timestamp":1773821393096}}
