{"type":"message","id":"d39a5d76","parentId":"77da7a0f","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:17:35.134Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```text\n<memories>\n  <facts>\n   -[2026-03-18 13:28] The code (C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\inquiryFormConfirm.zip) should only be used as a lightweight verification tool and must not generate new test cases. It should add markers such as error_message_verified_by_code, navigation_verified_by_code, and code_refs.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The WhatsApp gateway was successfully connected on March 18, 2026, at 13:01:18 GMT+9. The metadata source 'openclaw-control-ui' is classified as untrusted.\n   -[2026-03-18 14:34] The output of the pipeline was saved in C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\runs\\run-20260318-documentsResendFormConfirm.\n   -[2026-03-18 11:33] quality_gate_cases.py 脚本已在 web-unit-testbook 流水线中启用，支持 'off'、'warn'、'fail' 模式，使用 '--quality-gate' 和 '--min-confidence 0.70' 参数，默认行为为 warn，用于检测缺失或低置信度的 source_refs（置信度 < 0.7）并生成 quality_report.json 输出。\n   -[2026-03-18 09:37] 用户希望基于自身使用习惯，通过行为观察、规则提取、自动应用、反馈调整和安全边界设置，实现Lobster回复风格与内容逻辑的自动优化。\n   -[2026-03-18 16:54] The test specification has been updated to v8 version, with the file path: C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\【総務省様】_お問い合わせフォーム_単体テスト仕様書_overwrite_v8.xlsx. The update includes full coverage rewriting of both normal and abnormal cases, with all content aligned to the exact original text in the design document. Abnormal case test cases follow the 'page field input + corresponding error message' format, with error messages strictly aligned to the precise original text from the design document, including punctuation, full-width/half-width characters, and spacing.\n   -[2026-03-18 09:33] The MemOS Cloud memory plugin is available, with the API Key configured and gateway restarted successfully.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:18] The system can process multi-file content through a general rule engine, supports xlsx unpacking to extract images, parses XML relationships to determine image context, performs visual fingerprint matching (phash/dhash, size, color features), and conducts OCR to extract ocr_text, ui_elements, error_keywords, and confidence scores. It achieves approximately 80% automation coverage for common screenshots, flowcharts, and field description diagrams. Complex images (hand-drawn, blurry, cross-page logic) and those with confidence < 0.7 require manual review.\n   -[2026-03-18 10:09] The intermediate data format has been standardized, including fields: feature_id, feature_name, preconditions, steps, expected_results, exceptions, source_refs, and confidence score.\n  </facts>\n  <preferences>\n   -[2026-03-18 09:44] [Implicit Preference] 希望获取更多关于openclaw的操作和使用信息\n   -[2026-03-18 22:12] [Explicit Preference] 用户偏好将异常系的报错信息改成“页面字段填值 + 对应报错文言”风格\n   -[2026-03-18 13:22] [Implicit Preference] 希望通过调整置信度来改善问题分类的质量\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于逐步测试新工具以确保安全和有效性\n   -[2026-03-18 09:48] [Explicit Preference] 用户希望进行小规模试点后再逐步放权\n   -[2026-03-18 13:20] [Implicit Preference] 倾向于精确和严格的质量控制\n  </preferences>\n</memories>\n```\n\nuser​原​始​query​：​​​​\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-03-18 22:17 GMT+9] 可以 把这个流程总结一下 怎么实现的 更新到我的skills里"}],"timestamp":1773839855132}}
