{"type":"message","id":"e79af1a3","parentId":"51e94afe","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:18:02.498Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_15cX0llmjJ8NjVSeIG9j5zRl|fc_07e8e7856c2abc920169baa60a216c8191b2e90b05570d00fd","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: web-unit-testbook\ndescription: Generate web unit test books from design Excel + code (zip/folder) + user template. Use when user needs template-aligned test-case generation (STEP flow style), long-term stable export behavior, and reproducible .xlsx output.\n---\n\n# Web Unit Test Book\n\nUse `scripts/run_pipeline.py` as the only entry.\n\n## Modes\n\n- `high-precision` (default): UI-first generation from design + code-assisted verification metadata\n- `ui-only`: design-only fast generation\n\n## UI-first rule (enforced)\n\n- Case source is **design book UI content** (text/tables/images/OCR).\n- Code is **verify-only** for UI-facing assertions (error wording / navigation hints).\n- Do **not** expand case count by internal code `if/else` branch coverage.\n- Generated cases include verification markers:\n  - `error_message_verified_by_code`\n  - `navigation_verified_by_code`\n  - `code_refs[]`\n\n## Stable export policy (default)\n\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\n\nBehavior:\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\n\nTuning:\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\n\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `--design` design workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--code` code folder/zip (required in `high-precision`)\n- `--template` output template workbook (`.xlsx`)\n- `--outdir` output directory\n\n## Quality gate (P0 baseline)\n\nPipeline now supports quality gating and audit before Excel export:\n- `--quality-gate off|warn|fail` (default: `warn`)\n- `--min-confidence 0.70` (default)\n- `--multi-sheet-route off|auto` (default: `auto`)\n- `--strict-source-refs off|on` (default: `on`)\n- `--audit-conflicts off|on` (default: `on`, high-precision)\n\n`fail` mode blocks export when generated cases miss `source_refs` or fall below confidence threshold.\n\n## Command\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision --quality-gate warn --min-confidence 0.70 --multi-sheet-route auto --strict-source-refs on --audit-conflicts on\n```\n\nTemplate-first with explicit controls:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py --design <design.xlsx> --code <code_dir_or_zip> --template <template.xlsx> --outdir <out_dir> --mode high-precision --export-mode template-first --data-start-row 8 --match-threshold 0.20 --quality-gate fail --min-confidence 0.70 --multi-sheet-route auto --strict-source-refs on --audit-conflicts on\n```\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `design_rules.json`\n- `code_rules.json` (high-precision)\n- `cases.json`\n- `cases.enriched.json`\n- `UnitTestSpec.md`\n- `unit_test_book.xlsx`\n- `quality_report.json`\n- `conflict_audit.json` (high-precision + audit on)\n\n## References\n\n- `references/knowledge-base.md`\n- `references/templates/`\n- `references/rules/template-first-policy.md`\n- `references/rules/design-first-code-assist-policy.md`\n- `references/rules/image-to-case-mapping-rules-v1.yaml`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773839882495}}
