p4dsuvlhdjcL147wo9Fa_Q1nzpoSuwIuMUfGFvd35XsejkSmRhGae2eOIHopfMjCCt1XUrhVI86iMNpX7e92zB0BLy2LTpkjk9Mbw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Adding manual overwrite workflow**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_VSJZQXC7SXucjPM35fHzjeG6|fc_07e8e7856c2abc920169baa60f30cc819196a47a373503addf","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\references\\rules\\inquiry-1to1-overwrite-playbook.md","content":"# Inquiry 1:1 Overwrite Playbook (設計書原文対齐)\n\nUse this flow when the user asks:\n- 「正常系/異常系を設計書の精確原文で1:1対齐」\n- 「覆盖重写，不要增量补写」\n- 「异常系要页面字段填值 + 对应报错文言」\n\n## Goal\n\nGenerate an overwrite workbook where normal and abnormal cases are both aligned to design-book wording, including punctuation and full-/half-width characters.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Design: `...お問い合わせフォーム画面設計書.xlsx`\n- Code: `...inquiryFormConfirm.zip` (verify-only metadata; never case expansion source)\n- Template: stable unit-test template workbook (`...単体テスト仕様書.xlsx`)\n\n## Mandatory constraints\n\n1. UI-first only: case source = design/OCR content.\n2. Code verify-only: only annotate/verify (`error_message_verified_by_code`, `navigation_verified_by_code`, `code_refs`).\n3. Full overwrite: clear test data area and refill from row start (`data-start-row=8` typically).\n4. Template rhythm:\n   - STEP chain titles on first row of a STEP block only.\n   - Follow-up action rows keep title empty.\n   - Precondition default `ー`, result default `OK` unless template requires otherwise.\n\n## Execution flow\n\n1. Run base pipeline (`run_pipeline.py`) in `high-precision` mode with strict gate.\n2. Extract exact wording anchors from design workbook:\n   - Screen names for Step1/Step2/Step3 (normal flow)\n   - Error-message exact text from related check/spec sheets (abnormal flow)\n3. Perform overwrite export pass:\n   - Write normal flow with step-chain style.\n   - Write abnormal flow with `页面字段填值 + 对应报错文言` style.\n   - Resolve merged cells safely before writing (write to top-left cell of merged range).\n4. Save as `..._overwrite_v*.xlsx`.\n5. Quick verify sampled rows (IDs, titles, step text, expected text, precondition/result columns).\n\n## Quality checks\n\n- Keep quality gate enabled (`--min-confidence 0.70`, strict source refs on).\n- Verify no legacy rows remain after overwrite.\n- Verify abnormal messages are design-text exact where available.\n- If mismatch remains, do a character-level pass (punctuation/full-half width/spacing).\n\n## Recommended command baseline\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py \\\n  --design <design.xlsx> \\\n  --code <code.zip> \\\n  --template <template.xlsx> \\\n  --outdir <outdir> \\\n  --mode high-precision \\\n  --export-mode template-first \\\n  --data-start-row 8 \\\n  --match-threshold 0.20 \\\n  --quality-gate fail \\\n  --min-confidence 0.70 \\\n  --multi-sheet-route auto \\\n  --strict-source-refs on \\\n  --audit-conflicts on\n```\n\nThen run overwrite rewrite pass if the user requests strict 1:1 template wording output.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\references\\\\rules\\\\inquiry-1to1-overwrite-playbook.md\",\"content\":\"# Inquiry 1:1 Overwrite Playbook (設計書原文対齐)\\n\\nUse this flow when the user asks:\\n- 「正常系/異常系を設計書の精確原文で1:1対齐」\\n- 「覆盖重写，不要增量补写」\\n- 「异常系要页面字段填值 + 对应报错文言」\\n\\n## Goal\\n\\nGenerate an overwrite workbook where normal and abnormal cases are both aligned to design-book wording, including punctuation and full-/half-width characters.\\n\\n## Inputs\\n\\n- Design: `...お問い合わせフォーム画面設計書.xlsx`\\n- Code: `...inquiryFormConfirm.zip` (verify-only metadata; never case expansion source)\\n- Template: stable unit-test template workbook (`...単体テスト仕様書.xlsx`)\\n\\n## Mandatory constraints\\n\\n1. UI-first only: case source = design/OCR content.\\n2. Code verify-only: only annotate/verify (`error_message_verified_by_code`, `navigation_verified_by_code`, `code_refs`).\\n3. Full overwrite: clear test data area and refill from row start (`data-start-row=8` typically).\\n4. Template rhythm:\\n   - STEP chain titles on first row of a STEP block only.\\n   - Follow-up action rows keep title empty.\\n   - Precondition default `ー`, result default `OK` unless template requires otherwise.\\n\\n## Execution flow\\n\\n1. Run base pipeline (`run_pipeline.py`) in `high-precision` mode with strict gate.\\n2. Extract exact wording anchors from design workbook:\\n   - Screen names for Step1/Step2/Step3 (normal flow)\\n   - Error-message exact text from related check/spec sheets (abnormal flow)\\n3. Perform overwrite export pass:\\n   - Write normal flow with step-chain style.\\n   - Write abnormal flow with `页面字段填值 + 对应报错文言` style.\\n   - Resolve merged cells safely before writing (write to top-left cell of merged range).\\n4. Save as `..._overwrite_v*.xlsx`.\\n5. Quick verify sampled rows (IDs, titles, step text, expected text, precondition/result columns).\\n\\n## Quality checks\\n\\n- Keep quality gate enabled (`--min-confidence 0.70`, strict source refs on).\\n- Verify no legacy rows remain after overwrite.\\n- Verify abnormal messages are design-text exact where available.\\n- If mismatch remains, do a character-level pass (punctuation/full-half width/spacing).\\n\\n## Recommended command baseline\\n\\n```powershell\\npython scripts/run_pipeline.py \\\\\\n  --design <design.xlsx> \\\\\\n  --code <code.zip> \\\\\\n  --template <template.xlsx> \\\\\\n  --outdir <outdir> \\\\\\n  --mode high-precision \\\\\\n  --export-mode template-first \\\\\\n  --data-start-row 8 \\\\\\n  --match-threshold 0.20 \\\\\\n  --quality-gate fail \\\\\\n  --min-confidence 0.70 \\\\\\n  --multi-sheet-route auto \\\\\\n  --strict-source-refs on \\\\\\n  --audit-conflicts on\\n```\\n\\nThen run overwrite rewrite pass if the user requests strict 1:1 template wording output.\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usa