old` (default `0.20`)\n\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\n","new_string":"## Stable export policy (default)\n\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\n\nBehavior:\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\n\nTuning:\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\n\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\n\n## Strict overwrite mode (user-requested)\n\nUse this only when user explicitly asks for full rewrite (not incremental fill), especially for:\n- 「按设计书原文 1:1 对齐」\n- 「正常系/异常系都按固定步骤型模板重写」\n- 「异常系要页面字段填值 + 对应报错文言」\n\nRules:\n- Clear data area then refill (no legacy rows)\n- Keep STEP rhythm (title only at STEP start row; follow-up rows title empty)\n- Keep `precondition=ー`, `result=OK` unless template says otherwise\n- Align normal flow screen names and abnormal error wording to design-book exact text where available\n\nDetailed playbook: `references/rules/inquiry-1to1-overwrite-playbook.md`\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\吗喽\\\\.openclaw\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\web-unit-testbook\\\\SKILL.md\",\"old_string\":\"## Stable export policy (default)\\n\\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven projects.\\n\\nBehavior:\\n- Keep existing template rows/style (do not overwrite existing step wording by default)\\n- Fill aligned rows semantically (mainly `テスト条件` / `想定結果`)\\n- Append unmatched generated cases after the template data block\\n\\nTuning:\\n- `--data-start-row` (default `8`)\\n- `--match-threshold` (default `0.20`)\\n\\nUse `--export-mode append` only for blank/new templates.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"## Stable export policy (default)\\n\\n`--export-mode template-first` is default and should be kept for template-driven 